msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: zh-Hans\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

#. en: AvatarDoc created the submenu \"{0}\" for the install path of {1}.
msgid "ad.info.path_created"
msgstr "AvatarDoc 为 {1} 的安装路径创建了子菜单“{0}”。"

#. en: \"{0}\" joins the submenu of the same name that is already in the menu. ({1})
msgid "ad.info.same_submenu_merged"
msgstr "“{0}”已并入菜单中已有的同名子菜单。（{1}）"

#. en: The submenu \"{0}\" has more controls than VRChat allows on one page; the extra controls were moved to a \"More\" page. Move some controls into their own submenu to avoid the extra page.
msgid "ad.info.menu_split"
msgstr "子菜单“{0}”的控件数超过了 VRChat 单页允许的数量，多出的控件已移到“More”页。将部分控件移入单独的子菜单即可避免多出这一页。"

#. en: The entry \"{0}\" pointed at a submenu that no longer exists, so it was placed at the top of its component instead. Move it into a submenu that exists, or leave it here. ({1})
msgid "ad.warn.orphan_entry"
msgstr "条目“{0}”指向的子菜单已不存在，因此已改为放在其组件的顶层。请将它移入现有的子菜单，或保留在此处。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" has a missing target: an object, renderer, material slot or blend shape it pointed at is gone, so that row was skipped. Open \"{0}\" and fix or remove the empty target row. ({1})
msgid "ad.warn.target_missing"
msgstr "“{0}”有目标丢失：它指向的对象、渲染器、材质槽或形态键已不存在，因此已跳过该行。请打开“{0}”，修复或删除空的目标行。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" targets an object that is not part of this avatar, so that target was skipped. Pick a target that is part of this avatar. ({1})
msgid "ad.warn.target_outside_avatar"
msgstr "“{0}”的目标对象不属于此 Avatar，因此已跳过该目标。请选择属于此 Avatar 的目标。（{1}）"

#. en: The entry \"{0}\" shares its internal id with another entry (usually a copied component). Both still work; the inspector will assign a new id. ({1})
msgid "ad.warn.duplicate_entry_id"
msgstr "条目“{0}”与另一个条目的内部 ID 相同（通常是复制组件导致的）。两者仍可正常工作，Inspector 会为它分配新的 ID。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" already exists on the avatar, so its own saved, synced and default settings apply. ({1})
msgid "ad.info.parameter_reused"
msgstr "“{0}”已存在于 Avatar 上，因此沿用它自身的保存、同步和默认值设置。（{1}）"

#. en: {0} is changed by more than one control ({1}); the one built later wins: later menu entries first, triggers after every menu control. ({2})
msgid "ad.info.target_shared"
msgstr "{0} 被多个控件修改（{1}），以最后构建的为准：菜单中靠后的条目覆盖靠前的，触发器在所有菜单控件之后构建。（{2}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" is written by {1}; the override wins over every control, whatever the menu order. ({2})
msgid "ad.info.target_shared_override"
msgstr "“{0}”由 {1} 写入；无论菜单顺序如何，覆盖都优先于所有控件。（{2}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" has no targets, so nothing was generated for it. Add an object, blend shape or other target with \"+ Add\". ({1})
msgid "ad.warn.no_effects"
msgstr "“{0}”没有目标，因此没有为它生成任何内容。请用“+ 添加”添加对象、形态键或其他目标。（{1}）"

#. en: The exclusive group \"{0}\" has more than one toggle set as default; \"{1}\" is used because it comes first. Turn off \"Default on\" on the others. ({2})
msgid "ad.warn.group_multiple_defaults"
msgstr "互斥组“{0}”中有多个开关设为默认开启，因“{1}”排在最前而采用它。请关闭其他开关的“默认开启”。（{2}）"

#. en: The exclusive group \"{0}\" has two toggles with the value {1}. Change one of the values, or select one of the toggles and press \"Give each member its own value\". ({2})
msgid "ad.error.group_value_conflict"
msgstr "互斥组“{0}”中有两个开关的值都是 {1}。请修改其中一个值，或选中其中一个开关并点击“为每个成员分配不同的值”。（{2}）"

#. en: The parameter \"{0}\" is already {1} here, but this control needs a {2} parameter. Pick a different name, or match the type. ({3})
msgid "ad.error.parameter_type_conflict"
msgstr "参数“{0}”在此处已是 {1} 类型，但此控件需要 {2} 类型的参数。请换一个名称，或使类型一致。（{3}）"

#. en: Synced parameters need {0} bits but VRChat allows {1}. AvatarDoc adds {2} of them. Turn off \"Synced\" on toggles that do not need to sync, or remove some.
msgid "ad.error.bits_exceeded"
msgstr "同步参数需要 {0} bits，但 VRChat 只允许 {1} bits，其中 {2} bits 由 AvatarDoc 添加。请为不需要同步的开关关闭“同步”，或删除一些开关。"

#. en: Synced parameters need {0} bits but VRChat allows {1}. AvatarDoc adds {2} of them. VRCFury is installed and compresses parameters at upload until they fit, so the build goes on. To fit without VRCFury's help, turn off \"Synced\" on toggles that do not need to sync, or remove some.
msgid "ad.warn.bits_exceeded_vrcfury"
msgstr "同步参数需要 {0} bits，但 VRChat 只允许 {1} bits，其中 {2} bits 由 AvatarDoc 添加。已安装 VRCFury，它会在上传时压缩参数直到符合限制，因此构建会继续。如果不想依赖 VRCFury，请为不需要同步的开关关闭“同步”，或删除一些开关。"

#. en: The icon on \"{0}\" is {1}x{2} pixels or is not compressed, and VRChat's upload check rejects that. Re-import it at 256x256 pixels or smaller with compression turned on.
msgid "ad.error.menu_icon_too_large"
msgstr "“{0}”的图标为 {1}x{2} 像素或未压缩，VRChat 的上传检查会拒绝它。请以 256x256 像素或更小的尺寸并开启压缩重新导入。"

#. en: Your avatar's own FX layers mix Write Defaults on and off: on in {0}, off in {1}. Make every layer use the same setting; AvatarDoc otherwise builds with Write Defaults on.
msgid "ad.warn.write_defaults_mixed"
msgstr "Avatar 自身的 FX 层混用了 Write Defaults 开启和关闭：{0} 为开启，{1} 为关闭。请让所有层使用相同设置，否则 AvatarDoc 会以 Write Defaults 开启进行构建。"

#. en: The avatar has no FX playable layer, so AvatarDoc has nowhere to add toggles. Add an FX controller under \"Playable Layers\" in the avatar's VRC Avatar Descriptor.
msgid "ad.error.no_fx_layer"
msgstr "此 Avatar 没有 FX Playable Layer，AvatarDoc 无处添加开关。请在 Avatar 的 VRC Avatar Descriptor 中，于“Playable Layers”下添加 FX 控制器。"

#. en: The animation \"{0}\" also moves something \"{1}\" moves, so while that trigger is on, the trigger's own value shows there.
msgid "ad.info.curve_overwritten"
msgstr "动画“{0}”也会改变“{1}”所改变的内容，因此该触发器开启时，那里显示的是触发器自己的值。"

#. en: Clip \"{0}\" is one of VRChat's own proxy animations, so \"{1}\" left it alone and does not follow the shape while it plays. This is expected and needs no fix.
msgid "ad.warn.marker_clip_skipped"
msgstr "动画剪辑“{0}”是 VRChat 自带的 proxy 动画，因此“{1}”未改动它，在它播放时也不会跟随该形态键。这是正常现象，无需修复。"

#. en: The trigger \"{0}\" refers to a toggle, parameter, or blend shape that no longer exists, so it was skipped. Pick a source under \"When\" for it. ({1})
msgid "ad.warn.trigger_source_missing"
msgstr "触发器“{0}”引用的开关、参数或形态键已不存在，因此已跳过。请在“触发条件”下为它选择来源。（{1}）"

#. en: The trigger \"{1}\" reads the parameter \"{0}\", but nothing on this avatar declares it, so it is treated as a Float. Declare \"{0}\" under Parameters with its real type if it should be a whole number or true/false.
msgid "ad.warn.parameter_type_unknown"
msgstr "触发器“{1}”读取参数“{0}”，但此 Avatar 上没有任何地方声明它，因此按 Float 处理。如果它应该是整数或真/假值，请在“参数”中按实际类型声明“{0}”。"

#. en: \"{0}\" lists its own shape \"{1}\" as one of its effects, so that effect is ignored. Remove \"{1}\" from its effects list.
msgid "ad.warn.link_effect_is_source"
msgstr "“{0}”将自己的形态键“{1}”列为效果之一，因此忽略该效果。请从效果列表中移除“{1}”。"

#. en: \"{0}\" already exists in the avatar's animator, so this control drives it without adding a new parameter, but it will not sync to other players over the network. Declare \"{0}\" under Parameters if you need it to sync. ({1})
msgid "ad.info.parameter_animator_only"
msgstr "“{0}”已存在于 Avatar 的 Animator 中，因此此控件直接驱动它而不添加新参数，但它不会通过网络同步给其他玩家。如需同步，请在“参数”中声明“{0}”。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" is set to Replace but has no effect it can build, so the shape's own curve in the clip \"{1}\" was kept. Add an effect to the trigger, or set its Mode to Add.
msgid "ad.warn.replace_kept_source"
msgstr "“{0}”设为“替换”，但没有可构建的效果，因此保留了动画剪辑“{1}”中该形态键自身的曲线。请为触发器添加效果，或将其模式设为“叠加”。"

#. en: Override \"{0}\" holds \"{1}\" at its value in {2} animations.
msgid "ad.info.override_applied"
msgstr "覆盖“{0}”在 {2} 个动画中将“{1}”保持在设定值。"

#. en: Override \"{0}\" holds \"{1}\" at its value in {2} animation.
msgid "ad.info.override_applied.one"
msgstr "覆盖“{0}”在 {2} 个动画中将“{1}”保持在设定值。"

#. en: Override \"{0}\" found no animation that moves \"{1}\" on this avatar, so it only set the mesh's own value. Check that \"{1}\" and its renderer are the ones you meant, or remove this override if that is all you wanted. ({2})
msgid "ad.warn.override_unused"
msgstr "覆盖“{0}”在此 Avatar 上没有找到改变“{1}”的动画，因此只设置了网格自身的值。请确认“{1}”及其渲染器是否正确；如果只是想设置这个值，也可以删除此覆盖。（{2}）"

#. en: Overrides \"{0}\" and \"{1}\" both hold \"{2}\" at different values; \"{1}\" wins because it comes later. Remove one of them, or match their values. ({3})
msgid "ad.warn.override_conflict"
msgstr "覆盖“{0}”和“{1}”都将“{2}”保持在不同的值；“{1}”排在后面，因此以它为准。请删除其中一个，或使它们的值一致。（{3}）"

#. en: Override \"{0}\": its renderer no longer exists at build time, so the shape \"{1}\" was not pinned. Point it at a renderer that still exists on this avatar.
msgid "ad.warn.override_target_gone"
msgstr "覆盖“{0}”：构建时它的渲染器已不存在，因此形态键“{1}”未被钉住。请将它指向此 Avatar 上仍存在的渲染器。"

#. en: The change made to \"{0}\" would move its submenu into itself, so it was not applied. Pick a different \"Move to\" path for it. ({1})
msgid "ad.error.edit_cycle"
msgstr "对“{0}”的修改会把它的子菜单移入自身，因此未应用。请为它选择其他“移动到”路径。（{1}）"

#. en: The change made to \"{0}\" points at an AvatarDoc entry, so it was ignored. Edit \"{0}\" directly in its own panel instead. ({1})
msgid "ad.warn.edit_own_entry"
msgstr "对“{0}”的修改指向一个 AvatarDoc 条目，因此已忽略。请直接在“{0}”自己的面板中编辑。（{1}）"

#. en: The change saved for \"{0}\" cannot apply: that menu item was no longer found, so nothing changed. Use \"Remove\" to clear this edit.
msgid "ad.warn.edit_source_missing"
msgstr "为“{0}”保存的修改无法应用：找不到该菜单项，因此没有任何变化。请使用“移除”清除此修改。"

#. en: Preset \"{0}\" sets nothing yet, so pressing it does nothing. Add a control or parameter with \"+ Add\".
msgid "ad.warn.preset_empty"
msgstr "预设“{0}”尚未设置任何内容，按下它不会有任何效果。请用“+ 添加”添加控件或参数。"

#. en: The preset \"{0}\" refers to a control that no longer exists, so that row was skipped. Remove that row from the preset. ({1})
msgid "ad.warn.preset_target_missing"
msgstr "预设“{0}”引用的控件已不存在，因此已跳过该行。请从预设中删除该行。（{1}）"

#. en: A row of the preset \"{0}\" has no control yet, so it sets nothing. Pick a control with the row's button, or remove the row. ({1})
msgid "ad.info.preset_pick_control"
msgstr "预设“{0}”有一行还没有选择控件，因此该行不设置任何内容。请用该行的按钮选择控件，或删除该行。（{1}）"

#. en: The preset \"{0}\" turns on two members of the exclusive group \"{1}\" at once, but only one can be on; only the first listed is applied, and the upload stops until you fix it. Remove one of them from the preset. ({2})
msgid "ad.error.preset_group_conflict"
msgstr "预设“{0}”同时开启了互斥组“{1}”中的两个成员，但同一时间只能开启一个，因此只应用排在最前的那个，并且在修复之前上传会停止。请从预设中删除其中一个。（{2}）"

#. en: The parameter \"{0}\" set by the preset \"{1}\" is not declared in the expression parameters or the FX controller, so it is written anyway. Declare \"{0}\" under Parameters if you want VRChat to recognise it. ({2})
msgid "ad.warn.preset_parameter_unknown"
msgstr "预设“{1}”设置的参数“{0}”未在 Expression Parameters 或 FX 控制器中声明，但仍照常写入。如果希望 VRChat 识别它，请在“参数”中声明“{0}”。（{2}）"

#. en: \"{0}\": no material on \"{1}\" has the property \"{2}\", so that row was skipped. Pick a property that exists on \"{1}\"'s materials.
msgid "ad.warn.property_missing"
msgstr "“{0}”：“{1}”上没有任何材质具有属性“{2}”，因此已跳过该行。请选择“{1}”的材质上存在的属性。"

#. en: \"{0}\": the materials on \"{1}\" already disagree on \"{2}\". Turning it off writes the first material's value to all of them, except Poiyomi materials that rename it, which keep their own in game; edit the materials first if you want a different one used.
msgid "ad.warn.property_differs"
msgstr "“{0}”：“{1}”上各材质的“{2}”值本就不一致。关闭时会把第一个材质的值写入所有材质（把该属性设为 Renamed 的 Poiyomi 材质在游戏中会保留自己的值）；如果想使用其他值，请先编辑这些材质。"

#. en: \"{0}\": {3} Poiyomi materials on \"{2}\" ({4}) do not mark \"{1}\" as animated, so Poiyomi fixes it at its value when it locks them at upload, and the change does nothing in game. Select \"{0}\" and press \"Mark as animated\", or right-click the property in each material and choose Animated (when locked).
msgid "ad.warn.poiyomi_not_animated"
msgstr "“{0}”：“{2}”上的 {3} 个 Poiyomi 材质（{4}）没有把“{1}”标记为动画，因此 Poiyomi 在上传时锁定这些材质时会把它固定为当前值，游戏中不会有任何变化。请选中“{0}”并点击“标记为动画”，或在每个材质中右键点击该属性并选择 Animated (when locked)。"

#. en: \"{0}\": the Poiyomi material \"{4}\" on \"{2}\" does not mark \"{1}\" as animated, so Poiyomi fixes it at its value when it locks the material at upload, and the change does nothing in game. Select \"{0}\" and press \"Mark as animated\", or right-click the property in the material and choose Animated (when locked).
msgid "ad.warn.poiyomi_not_animated.one"
msgstr "“{0}”：“{2}”上的 Poiyomi 材质“{4}”没有把“{1}”标记为动画，因此 Poiyomi 在上传时锁定该材质时会把它固定为当前值，游戏中不会有任何变化。请选中“{0}”并点击“标记为动画”，或在该材质中右键点击该属性并选择 Animated (when locked)。"

#. en: \"{0}\": {3} Poiyomi materials on \"{2}\" ({4}) are locked with \"{1}\" fixed at its value, so the change does nothing in game. Unlock them, right-click the property in each and choose Animated (when locked), then lock them again or let Poiyomi lock them at upload.
msgid "ad.warn.poiyomi_baked"
msgstr "“{0}”：“{2}”上的 {3} 个 Poiyomi 材质（{4}）已锁定，“{1}”被固定为当前值，因此游戏中不会有任何变化。请解锁这些材质，在每个材质中右键点击该属性并选择 Animated (when locked)，然后重新锁定，或交给 Poiyomi 在上传时锁定。"

#. en: \"{0}\": the Poiyomi material \"{4}\" on \"{2}\" is locked with \"{1}\" fixed at its value, so the change does nothing in game. Unlock the material, right-click the property and choose Animated (when locked), then lock it again or let Poiyomi lock it at upload.
msgid "ad.warn.poiyomi_baked.one"
msgstr "“{0}”：“{2}”上的 Poiyomi 材质“{4}”已锁定，“{1}”被固定为当前值，因此游戏中不会有任何变化。请解锁该材质，右键点击该属性并选择 Animated (when locked)，然后重新锁定，或交给 Poiyomi 在上传时锁定。"

#. en: \"{0}\" is in an exclusive group, so its blend time is not used.
msgid "ad.info.blend_ignored_in_group"
msgstr "“{0}”属于互斥组，因此不使用其过渡时间。"

#. en: \"{0}\": the clip \"{1}\" is one of VRChat's own proxy clips, so it was not merged. This is expected and needs no fix.
msgid "ad.warn.animation_proxy"
msgstr "“{0}”：动画剪辑“{1}”是 VRChat 自带的 proxy 剪辑，因此未合并。这是正常现象，无需修复。"

#. en: \"{0}\": {1} generated values replace the same curve in its custom animation.
msgid "ad.info.animation_overridden"
msgstr "“{0}”：{1} 个生成的值替换了其自定义动画中的相同曲线。"

#. en: \"{0}\": {1} generated value replaces the same curve in its custom animation.
msgid "ad.info.animation_overridden.one"
msgstr "“{0}”：{1} 个生成的值替换了其自定义动画中的相同曲线。"

#. en: \"{0}\": {1} values in its custom animation do not match anything on this avatar, so they were left out of the off state. Check that clip's object paths and properties are correct.
msgid "ad.warn.animation_binding_missing"
msgstr "“{0}”：其自定义动画中有 {1} 个值与此 Avatar 上的任何内容都不匹配，因此未计入关闭状态。请检查该剪辑的对象路径和属性是否正确。"

#. en: \"{0}\": {1} value in its custom animation does not match anything on this avatar, so it was left out of the off state. Check that clip's object paths and properties are correct.
msgid "ad.warn.animation_binding_missing.one"
msgstr "“{0}”：其自定义动画中有 {1} 个值与此 Avatar 上的任何内容都不匹配，因此未计入关闭状态。请检查该剪辑的对象路径和属性是否正确。"

#. en: The action \"{0}\" was not carried over.
msgid "ad.import.note.unsupported_action"
msgstr "动作“{0}”未能转换。"

#. en: The toggle's transition animation was not carried over.
msgid "ad.import.note.transition"
msgstr "开关的过渡动画未能转换。"

#. en: The toggle's security lock was not carried over.
msgid "ad.import.note.security"
msgstr "开关的安全锁未能转换。"

#. en: The toggle's separate local state was not carried over.
msgid "ad.import.note.separate_local"
msgstr "开关的独立本地状态未能转换。"

#. en: The toggle's hold button behaviour was not carried over.
msgid "ad.import.note.hold_button"
msgstr "开关的按住按钮行为未能转换。"

#. en: The toggle's inverted rest logic was not carried over.
msgid "ad.import.note.invert_rest_logic"
msgstr "开关的反转静止逻辑未能转换。"

#. en: Only \"{1}\" became the exclusive group; the other tags ({0}) were dropped.
msgid "ad.import.note.extra_tags"
msgstr "只有“{1}”成为互斥组，其他标签（{0}）已舍弃。"

#. en: The clip's paths are used as they are. VRCFury may have rewritten them at build time, so check that they start at the avatar root.
msgid "ad.import.note.clip_paths"
msgstr "剪辑中的路径按原样使用。VRCFury 可能在构建时改写过这些路径，请检查它们是否从 Avatar 根对象开始。"

#. en: The blend shape \"{0}\" is deleted by Modular Avatar; deleting a shape cannot be carried over.
msgid "ad.import.note.shape_changer_delete"
msgstr "形态键“{0}”由 Modular Avatar 删除；删除形态键的操作无法转换。"

#. en: Modular Avatar's Inverted option on \"{0}\" cannot be carried over; that reaction was skipped.
msgid "ad.import.note.reactive_inverted"
msgstr "“{0}”上 Modular Avatar 的“反转条件”选项无法转换，已跳过该响应。"

#. en: A material slot that does not exist on \"{0}\" was skipped.
msgid "ad.import.note.slot_missing"
msgstr "已跳过“{0}”上不存在的材质槽。"

#. en: None of this item's actions could be carried over.
msgid "ad.import.reason.no_supported_action"
msgstr "此项的所有动作都无法转换。"

#. en: This item's effects come from an animator Modular Avatar merges from \"{0}\". AvatarDoc reads such a controller only when it is set and its layer type is FX. You can still rename, move, re-icon or hide the item.
msgid "ad.import.reason.ma_merge_animator"
msgstr "此项的效果来自 Modular Avatar 从“{0}”合并的 Animator。AvatarDoc 只读取已设置且 Layer 类型为 FX 的此类控制器。你仍可以重命名、移动、更换图标或隐藏此项。"

#. en: This item comes from a menu asset or a component that AvatarDoc cannot convert. You can still rename, move, re-icon or hide it.
msgid "ad.import.reason.nothing_here"
msgstr "此项来自 AvatarDoc 无法转换的菜单资源或组件。你仍可以重命名、移动、更换图标或隐藏它。"

#. en: Nothing under this submenu can be converted.
msgid "ad.import.reason.nothing_under"
msgstr "此子菜单下没有可转换的内容。"

#. en: This Modular Avatar menu item is not a Toggle.
msgid "ad.import.reason.not_a_toggle"
msgstr "此 Modular Avatar 菜单项的类型不是 Toggle。"

#. en: A locked component holds a menu edit for this item. Unlock it or remove the edit first.
msgid "ad.import.reason.edit_locked"
msgstr "某个已锁定的组件中有针对此项的菜单修改。请先解锁该组件或删除该修改。"

#. en: A curve's path does not resolve on this avatar; it was skipped.
msgid "ad.import.note.fx_path_missing"
msgstr "某条曲线的路径在此 Avatar 上找不到对应对象，已跳过。"

#. en: The material property \"{0}\" is only partly animated, so it could not be carried over.
msgid "ad.import.reason.property_partial"
msgstr "材质属性“{0}”只有部分被动画控制，因此无法转换。"

#. en: This control's parameter does not drive any FX layer.
msgid "ad.import.reason.fx_no_layer"
msgstr "此控件的参数没有驱动任何 FX 层。"

#. en: The parameter \"{0}\" is used by more than one layer, or elsewhere as a blend tree, motion time or speed parameter.
msgid "ad.import.reason.fx_parameter_shared"
msgstr "参数“{0}”被多个层使用，或在其他地方用作混合树、Motion Time 或速度参数。"

#. en: A transition into the on state also checks another parameter, so it could not be carried over.
msgid "ad.import.reason.fx_other_condition"
msgstr "进入开启状态的过渡还检查了另一个参数，因此无法转换。"

#. en: The layer has no state reachable on this parameter.
msgid "ad.import.reason.fx_no_on_state"
msgstr "该层中没有能通过此参数到达的状态。"

#. en: The on state's motion is a blend tree, which cannot be carried over.
msgid "ad.import.reason.fx_blend_tree"
msgstr "开启状态的 Motion 是混合树，无法转换。"

#. en: The on state has no motion.
msgid "ad.import.reason.fx_no_motion"
msgstr "开启状态没有 Motion。"

#. en: The curve \"{0}\" on {1} could not be carried over.
msgid "ad.import.reason.fx_unsupported_curve"
msgstr "{1} 上的曲线“{0}”无法转换。"

#. en: The layer \"{0}\" was already removed or renamed in the FX controller, so there was nothing here to remove. If you renamed it, update the name under \"Layers left out of the build\". ({1})
msgid "ad.warn.removed_layer_missing"
msgstr "层“{0}”已在 FX 控制器中被删除或重命名，因此这里没有可移除的内容。如果你重命名了它，请在“不参与构建的层”中更新名称。（{1}）"

#. en: The layer switches between several states on this parameter, so it cannot be converted one control at a time.
msgid "ad.import.reason.shared_layer"
msgstr "该层通过此参数在多个状态之间切换，因此无法逐个控件转换。"

#. en: Other menu controls use the same parameter.
msgid "ad.import.reason.shared_parameter_controls"
msgstr "其他菜单控件使用了相同的参数。"

#. en: The layer has state behaviours that a converted toggle would lose.
msgid "ad.import.reason.behaviours"
msgstr "该层带有状态行为（State Behaviour），转换后的开关会丢失这些行为。"

#. en: The avatar uses animator layer control, which refers to layers by position, so layers cannot be removed safely.
msgid "ad.import.reason.layer_control"
msgstr "此 Avatar 使用了 Animator 层控制，它按位置引用层，因此无法安全地移除层。"

#. en: The layer has a mask or a weight of zero.
msgid "ad.import.reason.layer_masked"
msgstr "该层带有遮罩，或权重为 0。"

#. en: The layer plays a transition animation between off and on.
msgid "ad.import.reason.transition_chain"
msgstr "该层在关闭和开启之间播放过渡动画。"

#. en: This layer was already converted.
msgid "ad.import.reason.already_converted"
msgstr "该层已转换过。"

#. en: Several layers share this name, so the old one cannot be left out safely.
msgid "ad.import.reason.layer_name_not_unique"
msgstr "有多个层使用此名称，因此无法安全地排除旧层。"

#. en: The old off state sets values that a toggle cannot reproduce.
msgid "ad.import.reason.off_values_differ"
msgstr "原关闭状态设置的值无法用开关重现。"

#. en: The layer rests in its on state but the parameter does not default to true, so what it should rest on could not be told.
msgid "ad.import.reason.inverted_default_mismatch"
msgstr "该层静止时处于开启状态，但参数默认值不是 true，因此无法判断它应该停在哪个状态。"

#. en: This set replaces a Merge Animator, so its originals have to be removed with it.
msgid "ad.import.reason.group_needs_removal"
msgstr "这一组会取代一个 Merge Animator，因此必须同时移除其原件。"

#. en: Anything outside the avatar that set the old parameter, such as an OSC app, has to use the new one.
msgid "ad.import.note.osc"
msgstr "Avatar 外部原本设置旧参数的程序（例如 OSC 应用）需要改用新参数。"

#. en: The layer is not one blend tree of two constant clips at 0 and 1 on this parameter, so it could not be carried over.
msgid "ad.import.reason.radial_shape"
msgstr "该层不是“由此参数在 0 和 1 处各放一个固定剪辑”的单一混合树，因此无法转换。"

#. en: The two ends of the blend tree animate different things, so they could not be carried over.
msgid "ad.import.reason.radial_bindings"
msgstr "混合树两端控制的内容不同，因此无法转换。"

#. en: Another layer copies this one's states, so it cannot be left out of the build safely.
msgid "ad.import.reason.synced_layer"
msgstr "另一个层同步了该层的状态，因此无法安全地将其排除在构建之外。"

#. en: Modular Avatar renames the parameter \"{0}\" at build time, so the names inside the merged animator would no longer match what gets declared. Nothing of this set can be converted.
msgid "ad.import.reason.ma_renamed_parameters"
msgstr "Modular Avatar 会在构建时重命名参数“{0}”，合并的 Animator 中的名称将与声明的名称不一致。这一组中的内容都无法转换。"

#. en: The merged animator layer \"{0}\" became this entry's own effects.
msgid "ad.import.note.merge_converted"
msgstr "合并的 Animator 层“{0}”已成为此条目自身的效果。"

#. en: This item keeps the parameter \"{0}\" and stays driven by the merged animator: {1}
msgid "ad.import.note.merge_parameter_control"
msgstr "此项保留参数“{0}”，仍由合并的 Animator 驱动：{1}"

#. en: A Button is momentary, which an entry cannot reproduce.
msgid "ad.import.note.merge_button"
msgstr "Button 是按下才生效的瞬时控件，条目无法重现。"

#. en: \"{0}\" was not removed because {1} layers share that same name, so removing by name would take all of them. Give the FX controller's layers unique names, then build again. ({2})
msgid "ad.warn.removed_layer_ambiguous"
msgstr "“{0}”未被移除，因为有 {1} 个层使用相同名称，按名称移除会把它们全部移除。请为 FX 控制器的各层设置不同的名称，然后重新构建。（{2}）"

#. en: Another layer drives this parameter; that keeps working.
msgid "ad.import.note.driven_elsewhere"
msgstr "另一个层也驱动此参数，它会继续正常工作。"

#. en: These items share the parameter \"{0}\", so they convert together as one exclusive group where only one can be on.
msgid "ad.import.note.ma_radio_set"
msgstr "这些项共用参数“{0}”，因此会一起转换为一个互斥组，同一时间只能开启其中一个。"

#. en: Another layer of this animator writes the parameter \"{0}\", and that layer stays merged.
msgid "ad.import.reason.driven_elsewhere"
msgstr "此 Animator 的另一个层会写入参数“{0}”，而该层仍会被合并。"

#. en: The old off state sets values of its own; they were carried over as this toggle's off values.
msgid "ad.import.note.off_values"
msgstr "原关闭状态设置了自己的值，这些值已转换为此开关的关闭值。"

#. en: The layer \"{0}\" and its parameter were kept because another controller in the build switches FX layers by their position, and removing one would shift the rest. Remove that layer control behaviour first if you still want \"{0}\" gone, then build again.
msgid "ad.warn.removed_layer_unsafe"
msgstr "层“{0}”及其参数已保留，因为构建中的另一个控制器按位置切换 FX 层，移除一个层会使其余层的位置发生偏移。如果仍要移除“{0}”，请先删除该层控制行为，然后重新构建。"

#. en: Layer \"{0}\" was not removed because the avatar uses animator layer control, and removing a layer would shift the ones after it by position. Remove that layer control first if you still want \"{0}\" gone, then build again. ({1})
msgid "ad.warn.converted_layer_unsafe"
msgstr "层“{0}”未被移除，因为此 Avatar 使用了 Animator 层控制，移除一个层会使其后的层位置发生偏移。如果仍要移除“{0}”，请先删除该层控制，然后重新构建。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" left the expression parameters and freed {1} synced bits.
msgid "ad.info.removed_parameter"
msgstr "“{0}”已从 Expression Parameters 中移除，释放了 {1} bits 同步参数。"

#. en: \"{0}\" left the expression parameters and freed {1} synced bit.
msgid "ad.info.removed_parameter.one"
msgstr "“{0}”已从 Expression Parameters 中移除，释放了 {1} bits 同步参数。"

#. en: \"{0}\" stays in the expression parameters: {1}
msgid "ad.info.removed_kept"
msgstr "“{0}”保留在 Expression Parameters 中：{1}"

#. en: another menu control uses it
msgid "ad.removal.kept.control"
msgstr "另一个菜单控件在使用它"

#. en: an AvatarDoc entry uses it
msgid "ad.removal.kept.entry"
msgstr "某个 AvatarDoc 条目在使用它"

#. en: an animator layer that stays reads it
msgid "ad.removal.kept.layer"
msgstr "某个保留的 Animator 层会读取它"

#. en: another animator of this avatar reads it
msgid "ad.removal.kept.other_controller"
msgstr "此 Avatar 的另一个 Animator 会读取它"

#. en: a parameter driver writes it
msgid "ad.removal.kept.driver"
msgstr "某个 Parameter Driver 会写入它"

#. en: a contact receiver or a PhysBone writes it
msgid "ad.removal.kept.contact"
msgstr "某个 Contact Receiver 或 PhysBone 会写入它"

#. en: another tool on the avatar uses it
msgid "ad.removal.kept.other_tool"
msgstr "Avatar 上的其他工具在使用它"

#. en: VRChat owns this parameter
msgid "ad.removal.kept.builtin"
msgstr "这是 VRChat 自带的参数"

#. en: The trigger \"{0}\" has no object set for \"Anchor\", so its contact has nowhere to attach. Pick an object for \"Anchor\". ({1})
msgid "ad.error.contact_no_anchor"
msgstr "触发器“{0}”的“锚点”未设置对象，其 Contact 无处附着。请为“锚点”选择一个对象。（{1}）"

#. en: The trigger \"{0}\" has no tags ticked under \"Touched by\", so nothing can touch it. Tick at least one tag. ({1})
msgid "ad.error.contact_no_tags"
msgstr "触发器“{0}”在“触碰来源”下没有勾选任何标签，因此什么都碰不到它。请至少勾选一个标签。（{1}）"

#. en: The trigger \"{0}\" has both \"Self\" and \"Others\" off, so its contact can never fire. Turn on \"Self\", \"Others\", or both. ({1})
msgid "ad.error.contact_nobody"
msgstr "触发器“{0}”的“自己”和“他人”都已关闭，其 Contact 永远不会触发。请开启“自己”、“他人”或两者。（{1}）"

#. en: The trigger \"{0}\" has no PhysBone chosen, so it has nothing to watch. Pick a PhysBone in its \"PhysBone\" field. ({1})
msgid "ad.error.physbone_missing"
msgstr "触发器“{0}”没有选择 PhysBone，因此没有可监视的对象。请在它的“PhysBone”字段中选择一个 PhysBone。（{1}）"

#. en: The trigger \"{0}\" cannot flip its \"Toggle\": none is picked, or the one picked is not a toggle. Pick a toggle for it to flip. ({1})
msgid "ad.error.flip_target"
msgstr "触发器“{0}”无法翻转其“开关”：未选择开关，或所选项不是开关。请选择一个要翻转的开关。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\": the parameter \"{1}\" needs to be {2} here, but the avatar already has it as {3}. Rename the PhysBone's parameter, or match the type. ({4})
msgid "ad.error.touch_parameter_type"
msgstr "“{0}”：参数“{1}”在此处需要是 {2} 类型，但 Avatar 上已有的同名参数是 {3} 类型。请重命名该 PhysBone 的参数，或使类型一致。（{4}）"

#. en: \"{0}\": its \"Anchor\" object or PhysBone belongs to another avatar. Pick one that is part of this avatar.
msgid "ad.error.touch_outside_avatar"
msgstr "“{0}”：其“锚点”对象或 PhysBone 属于另一个 Avatar。请选择属于此 Avatar 的对象。"

#. en: This avatar has no \"Head\" bone yet. Set its Animator to Humanoid and assign an Avatar, then try the start again.
msgid "ad.error.contact_start_no_head"
msgstr "此 Avatar 还没有“Head”骨骼。请将其 Animator 设为 Humanoid 并指定 Avatar，然后重新尝试。"

#. en: Fade on \"{0}\" reads only the card its first contact is in: that contact drives the fade and the rest of that card are requirements. The conditions in its other cards are kept but not used; move what you need into the first card with + And, or remove the other cards. ({1})
msgid "ad.warn.follow_distance_one_contact"
msgstr "“{0}”的渐变只读取第一个 Contact 所在的卡片：该 Contact 驱动渐变，卡片中的其余行是前提。其他卡片中的条件会保留但不使用；请用“+ 且”把需要的条件移到第一张卡片中，或删除其他卡片。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\": Follows cannot fade with distance and is not built in Follow distance. Switch to Hold to use it. ({1})
msgid "ad.warn.follow_distance_no_follows"
msgstr "“{0}”：跟随无法随距离渐变，在渐变模式下不会构建。请切换到“保持”以使用它。（{1}）"

#. en: {0} is left to \"{1}\", which already sets it to Animation. AvatarDoc's own pause layer was not built here.
msgid "ad.warn.follow_distance_tracking_left_to"
msgstr "{0}交由“{1}”控制，它已将其设为 Animation。AvatarDoc 未在此构建自己的暂停层。"

#. en: \"{0}\" watches the PhysBone \"{1}\", but Modular Avatar renames its parameter at build, so the trigger would watch the old name. Give \"{1}\" a parameter that Modular Avatar does not rename. ({2})
msgid "ad.warn.physbone_renamed"
msgstr "“{0}”监视 PhysBone“{1}”，但 Modular Avatar 会在构建时重命名其参数，触发器将监视旧名称。请为“{1}”设置一个 Modular Avatar 不会重命名的参数。（{2}）"

#. en: The default of group \"{0}\" is not built on this platform, so nothing in it is on by default here.
msgid "ad.info.group_default_excluded"
msgstr "组“{0}”的默认项不在此平台构建，因此在此平台上该组中没有默认开启的项。"

#. en: This merged animator has no \"Controller\" set, so nothing was merged from it. Pick a controller in its \"Controller\" field. ({0})
msgid "ad.warn.merge_no_controller"
msgstr "此合并 Animator 未设置“控制器”，因此没有合并任何内容。请在它的“控制器”字段中选择一个控制器。（{0}）"

#. en: The merged animator \"{0}\" is an Animator Override Controller whose own \"Controller\" field is empty, so it has nothing to merge and was left out. Set that field on \"{0}\", or pick a different animator. ({1})
msgid "ad.warn.merge_override_no_controller"
msgstr "合并 Animator“{0}”是一个 Animator Override Controller，但它自身的“Controller”字段为空，没有可合并的内容，因此已排除。请在“{0}”上设置该字段，或选择其他 Animator。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{1}\" has no layer named \"{0}\" to leave out, so that entry under \"Layers\" does nothing. Remove it, or fix the spelling to match a real layer. ({2})
msgid "ad.warn.merge_skip_missing"
msgstr "“{1}”中没有名为“{0}”的层可排除，因此“层”下的这一项不起作用。请删除它，或修正拼写以匹配实际存在的层。（{2}）"

#. en: The merged animator \"{0}\" has its \"Path root\" set to an object outside this avatar, so it was not merged. Point \"Path root\" at an object on this avatar, or leave it empty. ({1})
msgid "ad.error.merge_outside_avatar"
msgstr "合并 Animator“{0}”的“路径根对象”设为此 Avatar 之外的对象，因此未合并。请将“路径根对象”指向此 Avatar 上的对象，或留空。（{1}）"

#. en: The toggle \"{0}\" turns on \"Set a value when off\" for the blend shape \"{1}\", but that shape's effect is set to \"Pin\", which writes nothing while off. Turn off \"Set a value when off\", or change \"{1}\" away from \"Pin\". ({2})
msgid "ad.error.explicit_off_pin"
msgstr "开关“{0}”为形态键“{1}”开启了“关闭时设定值”，但该形态键的效果设为“钉住”，关闭时不写入任何值。请关闭“关闭时设定值”，或将“{1}”改为“钉住”以外的模式。（{2}）"

#. en: The merged animator \"{0}\" needs the parameter \"{1}\" as {2}, but the avatar already has it as {3}. Match the type or rename one of them. ({4})
msgid "ad.error.merge_parameter_type"
msgstr "合并 Animator“{0}”需要参数“{1}”为 {2} 类型，但 Avatar 上已有的同名参数是 {3} 类型。请使类型一致，或重命名其中一个。（{4}）"

#. en: Animator \"{0}\": the layer \"{1}\" is synced to \"{2}\", but \"{2}\" is left out of the merge. Include \"{2}\" too, or turn off the layer sync in the controller. ({3})
msgid "ad.error.merge_synced_layer"
msgstr "Animator“{0}”：层“{1}”同步自“{2}”，但“{2}”被排除在合并之外。请同时包含“{2}”，或在控制器中关闭该层的同步。（{3}）"

#. en: The merged animator \"{0}\" changes layer weights itself, so leaving layers out of it would point those changes at the wrong layer. Merge every layer, or remove the layer control. ({1})
msgid "ad.error.merge_layer_control"
msgstr "合并 Animator“{0}”会自行修改层权重，排除其中的层会使这些修改作用到错误的层上。请合并所有层，或删除该层控制。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" drives the parameter \"{1}\", but nothing on this avatar reads it, so it has no effect yet. Remove it, or point it at a parameter a merged animator, VRCFury or Modular Avatar actually uses. ({2})
msgid "ad.warn.parameter_control_unused"
msgstr "“{0}”驱动参数“{1}”，但此 Avatar 上没有任何地方读取它，因此暂时没有效果。请删除它，或将它指向合并 Animator、VRCFury 或 Modular Avatar 实际使用的参数。（{2}）"

#. en: \"{0}\": its toggle is not built on this platform, so the touch does nothing here.
msgid "ad.info.flip_target_excluded"
msgstr "“{0}”：其开关不在此平台构建，因此在此平台上触碰不会有任何效果。"

#. en: This avatar and \"{0}\" share a blueprint but their parameters differ at position {1}: \"{2}\" here, \"{3}\" there, so other platforms would see the wrong toggles. Rebuild both platforms from the same menu order to fix it.
msgid "ad.warn.platform_parity"
msgstr "此 Avatar 与“{0}”使用同一个 Blueprint ID，但它们的参数在第 {1} 位不同：此处为“{2}”，那里为“{3}”，其他平台会看到错误的开关。请按相同的菜单顺序重新构建两个平台以修复。"

#. en: The trigger \"{0}\" needs a toggle for \"Only while\", but the one picked is missing, a preset, or the toggle this trigger already flips. Pick a different toggle for \"Only while\". ({1})
msgid "ad.error.gate_target"
msgstr "触发器“{0}”的“仅当”需要一个开关，但所选项已丢失、是预设，或正是此触发器要翻转的开关。请为“仅当”选择其他开关。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" has no menu button, so nothing can turn it on unless something else drives it. Turn on \"Default on\", add it to a preset, or add a trigger that flips it. ({1})
msgid "ad.info.hidden_toggle_unreachable"
msgstr "“{0}”没有菜单按钮，除非有其他东西驱动它，否则无法开启。请开启“默认开启”、将它加入预设，或添加一个翻转它的触发器。（{1}）"

