msgid "ad.summary.shape_sets.line"
msgstr "{0}：“{1}”，其他最多 {2} 个形态键保持为 0"

#. en: {0}: \"{1}\", up to {2} other shape held at 0
msgid "ad.summary.shape_sets.line.one"
msgstr "{0}：“{1}”，其他最多 {2} 个形态键保持为 0"

#. en: {0}: \"{1}\", up to {2} other shapes held at their default
msgid "ad.summary.shape_sets.line.default"
msgstr "{0}：“{1}”，其他最多 {2} 个形态键保持为默认值"

#. en: {0}: \"{1}\", up to {2} other shape held at its default
msgid "ad.summary.shape_sets.line.default.one"
msgstr "{0}：“{1}”，其他最多 {2} 个形态键保持为默认值"

#. en: \"{0}\" cannot follow anything: only a toggle or a trigger has an on and off state to drive a Follow row. Move this row to a toggle or a trigger, or remove it. ({1})
msgid "ad.error.follow_not_on_off"
msgstr "“{0}”无法跟随任何东西：只有开关或触发器才有开启和关闭状态来驱动跟随行。请将此行移到开关或触发器上，或删除它。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" cannot follow: the object and the target it should follow are the same one. Pick a different target to follow. ({1})
msgid "ad.error.follow_self"
msgstr "“{0}”无法跟随：对象与它要跟随的目标是同一个。请选择其他跟随目标。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\": the object or the transform it should follow is not part of this avatar, so this Follow row was skipped. Pick an object and a target that are both part of this avatar. ({1})
msgid "ad.error.follow_outside_avatar"
msgstr "“{0}”：对象或它要跟随的 Transform 不属于此 Avatar，因此已跳过此跟随行。请选择都属于此 Avatar 的对象和目标。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\": \"{1}\" already carries a constraint of its own, so AvatarDoc left it alone. Remove that constraint first if you want AvatarDoc to drive \"{1}\", or pick a different object. ({2})
msgid "ad.error.follow_existing_constraint"
msgstr "“{0}”：“{1}”上已有约束，因此 AvatarDoc 未改动它。如果希望由 AvatarDoc 驱动“{1}”，请先删除该约束，或选择其他对象。（{2}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" cannot follow: the avatar's root object has no parent of its own to rest under when the control is off. Put the avatar under an empty parent object, then build again. ({1})
msgid "ad.error.follow_no_rest_parent"
msgstr "“{0}”无法跟随：Avatar 的根对象自身没有父对象，控件关闭时无处归位。请将 Avatar 放到一个空的父对象下，然后重新构建。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" has {1} follow rows, more than the {2} VRChat allows on one object. Remove or combine some of these rows: {3}.
msgid "ad.error.follow_too_many_sources"
msgstr "“{0}”有 {1} 个跟随行，超过了 VRChat 单个对象允许的 {2} 个。请删除或合并其中一些行：{3}。"

#. en: \"{0}\" cannot follow \"{1}\": its trigger condition could not be resolved, so it will never follow. Fix that trigger's \"When\" condition first. ({2})
msgid "ad.warn.follow_claim_unresolved"
msgstr "“{0}”无法跟随“{1}”：其触发条件无法解析，因此永远不会跟随。请先修复该触发器的“触发条件”。（{2}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" needs an object to grab before it can build anything. Pick an object for its \"Object\" field. ({1})
msgid "ad.error.grab_no_object"
msgstr "“{0}”需要一个可抓取的对象才能构建。请在它的“对象”字段中选择一个对象。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\": the object it grabs is not part of this avatar, so it cannot build. Pick an object that is part of this avatar. ({1})
msgid "ad.error.grab_outside_avatar"
msgstr "“{0}”：要抓取的对象不属于此 Avatar，因此无法构建。请选择属于此 Avatar 的对象。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" cannot grab: the avatar has no humanoid rig, or is missing a hand bone that its \"Hands\" setting needs. Set the avatar's rig to Humanoid with both hands mapped. ({1})
msgid "ad.error.grab_no_hand"
msgstr "“{0}”无法抓取：Avatar 没有 Humanoid 骨架，或缺少“手”设置所需的手部骨骼。请将 Avatar 的 Rig 设为 Humanoid，并映射好双手。（{1}）"

#. en: \"{0}\": its object already sits inside \"{1}\"'s own PhysBone chain, so a second PhysBone cannot be added there. Pick a different object, or move it out of that chain. ({2})
msgid "ad.error.grab_inside_physbone"
msgstr "“{0}”：其对象已位于“{1}”自身的 PhysBone 链中，无法再添加第二个 PhysBone。请选择其他对象，或将它移出该链。（{2}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" reuses the PhysBone already on its object instead of adding a second one.
msgid "ad.info.grab_uses_existing_physbone"
msgstr "“{0}”复用其对象上已有的 PhysBone，而不是再添加一个。"

#. en: \"{0}\" reuses a PhysBone that does not allow grabbing, or whose root is a different object. Turn on grabbing on that PhysBone, and set its root to this object.
msgid "ad.warn.grab_existing_physbone_unsuitable"
msgstr "“{0}”复用的 PhysBone 不允许抓取，或其根对象是另一个对象。请在该 PhysBone 上开启抓取，并将其根设为此对象。"

#. en: Follows
msgid "ad.ui.targets.follows"
msgstr "跟随"

#. en: Keep offset
msgid "ad.ui.target.keep_offset"
msgstr "保持偏移"

#. en: Follows
msgid "ad.summary.follows"
msgstr "跟随"

#. en: {0}: \"{1}\" follows \"{2}\"
msgid "ad.summary.follows.line"
msgstr "{0}：“{1}”跟随“{2}”"

#. en: Grabbables
msgid "ad.summary.grabbables"
msgstr "可抓取物"

#. en: {0}: \"{1}\" is held by {2}
msgid "ad.summary.grabbables.line"
msgstr "{0}：“{1}”由{2}持握"

#. en: + Grabbable
msgid "ad.ui.add.grabbable"
msgstr "+ 可抓取物"

#. en: Grabbable
msgid "ad.ui.detail.grabbable"
msgstr "可抓取物"

#. en: Object
msgid "ad.ui.grab.object"
msgstr "对象"

#. en: Hands
msgid "ad.ui.grab.hands"
msgstr "手"

#. en: Both
msgid "ad.ui.grab.hands.both"
msgstr "双手"

#. en: Left
msgid "ad.ui.grab.hands.left"
msgstr "左手"

#. en: Right
msgid "ad.ui.grab.hands.right"
msgstr "右手"

#. en: Builds a PhysBone, one contact per hand, and a follow that snaps the object into the hand that holds it.
msgid "ad.ui.grab.summary"
msgstr "构建一个 PhysBone、每只手一个 Contact，以及一个让对象吸附到持握它的手中的跟随。"

#. en: Anyone may grab
msgid "ad.ui.grab.anyone"
msgstr "任何人可抓取"

#. en: Return time
msgid "ad.ui.grab.return_seconds"
msgstr "归位时间"

#. en: Menu toggle
msgid "ad.ui.grab.menu_toggle"
msgstr "菜单开关"

#. en: Reach
msgid "ad.ui.grab.reach"
msgstr "抓取范围"

#. en: More options
msgid "ad.ui.grab.fold"
msgstr "更多选项"

#. en: Jumps to the AvatarDoc component that actually owns this entry so you can edit it there.
msgid "ad.ui.select_component.tip"
msgstr "跳转到实际拥有此条目的 AvatarDoc 组件，以便在那里编辑。"

#. en: The picture VRChat shows for this control in its menu.
msgid "ad.ui.icon.tip"
msgstr "VRChat 在菜单中为此控件显示的图片。"

#. en: Opens a window that renders only this entry's own pieces and saves the result as its icon.
msgid "ad.ui.capture.tip"
msgstr "打开一个只渲染此条目自身部件的窗口，并将结果保存为它的图标。"

#. en: Chooses which build actually creates this entry; its parameter still keeps its place on every platform.
msgid "ad.ui.platform.tip"
msgstr "选择在哪个平台的构建中实际创建此条目；它的参数在所有平台上仍保留原有位置。"

#. en: Starts this toggle on when the avatar loads.
msgid "ad.ui.default_on.tip"
msgstr "Avatar 加载时此开关处于开启状态。"

#. en: Remembers this control's state between avatar loads.
msgid "ad.ui.saved.tip"
msgstr "在多次加载 Avatar 之间记住此控件的状态。"

#. en: Costs a synced bit and lets other players see this control's state.
msgid "ad.ui.synced.tip"
msgstr "占用同步参数，让其他玩家也能看到此控件的状态。"

#. en: Off removes this control's button from the menu but keeps its parameter and effects working.
msgid "ad.ui.in_menu.tip"
msgstr "关闭后会从菜单中移除此控件的按钮，但其参数和效果仍正常工作。"

#. en: Only one toggle sharing this same group name can be on at a time.
msgid "ad.ui.group.tip"
msgstr "使用相同组名的开关中，同一时间只能有一个开启。"

#. en: The number the group's parameter takes while this toggle is on. 0 lets AvatarDoc pick one.
msgid "ad.ui.group.value.tip"
msgstr "此开关开启时，组的参数所取的数值。填 0 则自动分配。"

#. en: Numbers the members of this group 1, 2, 3 and so on in menu order, so no two share a value.
msgid "ad.ui.group.number.tip"
msgstr "按菜单顺序把这个组的成员依次设为 1、2、3……，使任何两个成员都不共用同一个值。"

#. en: Marks the property Animated (when locked) on the Poiyomi materials this warning names, in one Undo step, so it still changes in game after Poiyomi locks them at upload.
msgid "ad.ui.poiyomi.mark_animated.tip"
msgstr "在此警告列出的 Poiyomi 材质上把该属性设为 Animated (when locked)，使 Poiyomi 在上传时锁定后它仍能在游戏中变化，可一步撤销。"

#. en: The synced value VRChat uses for this control, named automatically unless you give it your own.
msgid "ad.ui.parameter.tip"
msgstr "VRChat 为此控件使用的同步值，除非你自定义名称，否则会自动命名。"

#. en: Names the parameter yourself so it can reuse or drive one that already exists on the avatar.
msgid "ad.ui.parameter.use_custom.tip"
msgstr "自行命名参数，以便复用或驱动 Avatar 上已有的参数。"

#. en: The value this toggle writes to its parameter while it is on.
msgid "ad.ui.parameter.value.tip"
msgstr "此开关开启时写入其参数的值。"

#. en: Shows this control's targets on the avatar in the Scene without changing anything in the build.
msgid "ad.ui.preview.tip"
msgstr "在 Scene 中的 Avatar 上显示此控件的目标效果，不会改变构建中的任何内容。"

#. en: Clears the preview override and falls back to this control's own default state.
msgid "ad.ui.preview.default.tip"
msgstr "清除预览覆盖，恢复为此控件自身的默认状态。"

#. en: Flips the target toggle's own preview once, the same as a real touch would.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.simulate.tip"
msgstr "像真实触碰一样，将目标开关的预览翻转一次。"

#. en: This control has no button in the built menu, though its parameter and effects still work.
msgid "ad.ui.chip.no_menu.tip"
msgstr "此控件在构建出的菜单中没有按钮，但其参数和效果仍正常工作。"

#. en: Picks what starts this trigger: another toggle, a parameter, a blend shape, a touch or a PhysBone.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.when.tip"
msgstr "选择由什么启动此触发器：另一个开关、参数、形态键、触碰或 PhysBone。"

#. en: The toggle whose state starts this trigger.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.toggle.tip"
msgstr "以其状态启动此触发器的开关。"

#. en: Whether the toggle has to be on or off for the trigger to fire.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.toggle_state.tip"
msgstr "开关需要处于开启还是关闭状态，触发器才会触发。"

#. en: The parameter this trigger watches; pick one from the list or type a name by hand.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.parameter.tip"
msgstr "此触发器监视的参数；可从列表中选择，或手动输入名称。"

#. en: How the parameter's value must compare before the trigger fires.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.condition.tip"
msgstr "参数值需要满足怎样的比较关系，触发器才会触发。"

#. en: The value the condition compares the parameter against.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.value.tip"
msgstr "条件中与参数进行比较的值。"

#. en: The blend shape whose weight drives this trigger's effects.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.shape.tip"
msgstr "以其权重驱动此触发器效果的形态键。"

#. en: Add keeps the shape moving as its animations say with the effects on top; Replace takes the shape's own animation out so only the effects show.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.mode.tip"
msgstr "叠加：形态键仍按其动画变化，效果叠加在上面；替换：移除形态键自身的动画，只显示效果。"

#. en: Limits this trigger to firing only while the chosen toggle is on or off.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.gate.tip"
msgstr "限制此触发器只在所选开关开启或关闭时才触发。"

#. en: Whether the gate toggle must be on or off for this trigger to be allowed to fire.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.gate_state.tip"
msgstr "限定开关需要处于开启还是关闭状态，此触发器才允许触发。"

#. en: Creates a plain menu toggle and sets it as this trigger's gate in one step.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.gate.add.tip"
msgstr "一步创建一个普通菜单开关，并将其设为此触发器的限定开关。"

#. en: The text this control shows; style it below with colour, bold or italic.
msgid "ad.ui.name.tip"
msgstr "此控件显示的文字；可在下方设置颜色、粗体或斜体。"

#. en: Colours and styles the whole name at once; switch to Tags to hand edit part of it.
msgid "ad.ui.style.tip"
msgstr "一次为整个名称设置颜色和样式；切换到“标签”可手动编辑其中一部分。"

#. en: Sets the name's colour; the x beside it clears it back to none.
msgid "ad.ui.style.color.tip"
msgstr "设置名称的颜色；点击旁边的 x 可清除颜色。"

#. en: Clears the name's colour.
msgid "ad.ui.style.clear_color.tip"
msgstr "清除名称的颜色。"

#. en: Makes the whole name bold.
msgid "ad.ui.style.bold.tip"
msgstr "将整个名称设为粗体。"

#. en: Makes the whole name italic.
msgid "ad.ui.style.italic.tip"
msgstr "将整个名称设为斜体。"

#. en: Shows the name's raw text with its colour and style tags written out, to style part of it by hand.
msgid "ad.ui.style.raw.tip"
msgstr "显示名称的原始文本及其中写出的颜色和样式标签，以便手动为其中一部分设置样式。"

#. en: How VRChat will actually render this name, tags included.
msgid "ad.ui.style.preview.tip"
msgstr "VRChat 实际显示此名称的效果（包括标签）。"

#. en: Moves this item into another submenu without touching the tool that created it.
msgid "ad.ui.existing.move.tip"
msgstr "将此菜单项移到另一个子菜单，不会改动创建它的工具。"

#. en: Clears every change here and puts the item back exactly as the avatar or the tool built it.
msgid "ad.ui.existing.reset.tip"
msgstr "清除此处的所有修改，让此菜单项完全恢复为 Avatar 或工具原本生成的样子。"

#. en: The controller whose layers merge into the build; the asset itself is never changed.
msgid "ad.ui.animator.controller.tip"
msgstr "其层会合并到构建中的控制器；资源本身不会被修改。"

#. en: Makes the merged layers follow the avatar's own Write Defaults choice instead of the controller's own.
msgid "ad.ui.animator.match_write_defaults.tip"
msgstr "让合并的层遵循 Avatar 自身的 Write Defaults 设置，而不是控制器自己的设置。"

#. en: Unticking a layer leaves it out of the merge entirely.
msgid "ad.ui.animator.layers.tip"
msgstr "取消勾选某个层，会将其完全排除在合并之外。"

#. en: Lists every parameter the controller uses and who is already responsible for it.
msgid "ad.ui.animator.parameters.tip"
msgstr "列出控制器使用的所有参数，以及目前由谁负责提供它。"

#. en: Gives this parameter a menu control here, without adding another layer for it.
msgid "ad.ui.animator.add_control.tip"
msgstr "在此为该参数添加菜单控件，不会为它另外添加层。"

#. en: The finished menu this component installs; it is never changed, only copied into the build.
msgid "ad.ui.menu_asset.asset.tip"
msgstr "此组件安装的现成菜单；它不会被修改，只会被复制到构建中。"

#. en: As submenu wraps the asset in one new submenu; Append items puts its controls directly into the menu.
msgid "ad.ui.menu_asset.place.tip"
msgstr "作为子菜单：将该资源放进一个新的子菜单；追加菜单项：将其控件直接放入菜单。"

#. en: The submenu's own name; only used while it installs As submenu.
msgid "ad.ui.menu_asset.name.tip"
msgstr "子菜单自身的名称；仅在以“作为子菜单”方式安装时使用。"

#. en: Every parameter this asset's controls need, and who already provides it.
msgid "ad.ui.menu_asset.parameters.tip"
msgstr "此资源的控件所需的所有参数，以及目前由谁提供。"

#. en: Declares this parameter here so VRChat does not ignore the control that needs it.
msgid "ad.ui.menu_asset.declare.tip"
msgstr "在此声明该参数，以免 VRChat 忽略需要它的控件。"

#. en: Declares a parameter of your own, for a menu asset or a merged animator that needs one.
msgid "ad.ui.parameters.add.tip"
msgstr "自行声明一个参数，供需要它的菜单资源或合并 Animator 使用。"

#. en: The name this declared parameter uses; match an existing avatar parameter to reuse it.
msgid "ad.ui.parameters.row_name.tip"
msgstr "此声明参数使用的名称；与 Avatar 上已有参数同名即可复用。"

#. en: Bool, Int or Float: the kind of value this parameter holds.
msgid "ad.ui.parameters.type.tip"
msgstr "Bool、Int 或 Float：此参数保存的值的类型。"

#. en: The value this parameter starts with when the avatar loads.
msgid "ad.ui.parameters.default.tip"
msgstr "Avatar 加载时此参数的初始值。"

#. en: Every control this preset puts into a state when it is pressed.
msgid "ad.ui.preset.sets.tip"
msgstr "按下此预设时会被设置状态的所有控件。"

#. en: Adds another control for this preset to set.
msgid "ad.ui.preset.add.tip"
msgstr "再添加一个由此预设设置的控件。"

#. en: Adds another parameter this preset writes, such as one from VRCFury or Modular Avatar.
msgid "ad.ui.preset.parameters.add.tip"
msgstr "再添加一个由此预设写入的参数，例如来自 VRCFury 或 Modular Avatar 的参数。"

#. en: The control this row sets; click to pick a different one from the menu.
msgid "ad.ui.preset.control.tip"
msgstr "此行设置的控件；点击可从菜单中选择其他控件。"

#. en: How far this radial is set when the preset is applied.
msgid "ad.ui.preset.value.tip"
msgstr "应用预设时此转盘设置到的值。"

#. en: Whether this control is switched on or off when the preset is applied.
msgid "ad.ui.preset.on.tip"
msgstr "应用预设时此控件是开启还是关闭。"

#. en: The parameter this row writes; pick one from the list or type a name by hand.
msgid "ad.ui.preset.param_name.tip"
msgstr "此行写入的参数；可从列表中选择，或手动输入名称。"

#. en: The value written to that parameter when the preset is applied.
msgid "ad.ui.preset.param_value.tip"
msgstr "应用预设时写入该参数的值。"

#. en: The object the contact sphere follows, usually a bone.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.anchor.tip"
msgstr "Contact 球体跟随的对象，通常是骨骼。"

#. en: How big the contact sphere is, from 0.005 to 1.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.radius.tip"
msgstr "Contact 球体的大小，范围 0.005 到 1。"

#. en: How far the sphere sits from the anchor.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.offset.tip"
msgstr "球体与锚点之间的偏移距离。"

#. en: Whether your own colliders, other players' colliders, or both, can touch this contact.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.who.tip"
msgstr "可触碰此 Contact 的是你自己的碰撞体、其他玩家的碰撞体，还是两者皆可。"

#. en: Lets your own colliders touch this contact.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.self.tip"
msgstr "允许你自己的碰撞体触碰此 Contact。"

#. en: Lets other players' colliders touch this contact.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.others.tip"
msgstr "允许其他玩家的碰撞体触碰此 Contact。"

#. en: Which VRChat contact tags can reach this contact; none ticked means it touches nobody.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.tags.tip"
msgstr "哪些 VRChat Contact 标签可以触及此 Contact；一个都不勾选则谁也碰不到它。"

#. en: Shows the rest of VRChat's own contact tags.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.more_tags.tip"
msgstr "显示 VRChat 自带的其余 Contact 标签。"

#. en: Removes this tag from the list.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.custom_tag_chip.tip"
msgstr "从列表中移除此标签。"

#. en: Adds any other contact tag this contact should also react to.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.custom_tag.tip"
msgstr "添加此 Contact 还应响应的其他 Contact 标签。"

#. en: Touch fires only on contact; Closer than fires once something is near, using a fraction of the radius.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.distance.tip"
msgstr "触碰：只在接触时触发；近于：有物体靠近到半径的一定比例以内时触发。"

#. en: How close something must get before Closer than counts as met.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.proximity.tip"
msgstr "物体需要靠近到什么程度，“近于”才算满足。"

#. en: The PhysBone this trigger watches.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.physbone.tip"
msgstr "此触发器监视的 PhysBone。"

#. en: Which PhysBone state starts this trigger: grabbed, posed, or past a bend, stretch or squish amount.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.event.tip"
msgstr "由哪种 PhysBone 状态启动此触发器：被抓取、被摆放，或弯曲、拉伸、挤压超过一定幅度。"

#. en: How far the PhysBone has to bend, stretch or squish before this trigger fires.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.threshold.tip"
msgstr "PhysBone 需要弯曲、拉伸或挤压到什么程度，此触发器才会触发。"

#. en: Hold applies while the touch is active, Flip flips a toggle's own parameter on each touch, and Fade blends the effects in as the hand gets closer.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.mode.tip"
msgstr "保持：触碰期间生效；翻转：每次触碰都翻转一个开关自身的参数；渐变：手越靠近，效果越明显。"

#. en: Applies the trigger's own targets while the touch is active, and stops the moment it is not.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.hold.tip"
msgstr "触碰期间应用触发器自身的目标，触碰结束时立即停止。"

#. en: Flips a toggle's own parameter on each touch, through a local parameter driver.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.flip.tip"
msgstr "每次触碰时，通过本地 Parameter Driver 翻转一个开关自身的参数。"

#. en: Effects fade in as a hand comes closer, fully on at the Fully on at value.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.follow.tip"
msgstr "手越靠近，效果越明显，达到“完全开启于”的值时完全开启。"

#. en: The toggle this trigger flips on each touch; other players can flip it too when Others is on.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.flip_target.tip"
msgstr "每次触碰时此触发器翻转的开关；开启“他人”时，其他玩家也能翻转它。"

#. en: How close the hand must get, as a fraction of the radius, before the effects are fully on.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.fullat.tip"
msgstr "手需要靠近到半径的多少比例，效果才会完全开启。"

#. en: How big the contact sphere is, and where the effects start fading in, from 0.005 to 1.
msgid "ad.ui.touch.radius_follow.tip"
msgstr "Contact 球体的大小，也是效果开始渐入的位置，范围 0.005 到 1。"

#. en: Adds another condition that must also be true in this group.
msgid "ad.ui.when.add_and.tip"
msgstr "在此组中再添加一个也必须满足的条件。"

#. en: A group holds at most {0} conditions: use + Or to start another group.
msgid "ad.ui.when.add_and.limit.tip"
msgstr "每组最多 {0} 个条件：请使用“+ 或”新建一个组。"

#. en: Adds a new group; the trigger fires while any group is fully met.
msgid "ad.ui.when.add_or.tip"
msgstr "添加一个新组；任一组完全满足时触发器即触发。"

#. en: Every condition in this group must be true together.
msgid "ad.ui.when.all_of.tip"
msgstr "此组中的所有条件必须同时满足。"

#. en: What this condition reads: a toggle, a parameter, a contact or a PhysBone.
msgid "ad.ui.when.kind.tip"
msgstr "此条件读取的内容：开关、参数、Contact 或 PhysBone。"

#. en: Opens this condition's contact or PhysBone settings and its Scene view handle.
msgid "ad.ui.when.settings.tip"
msgstr "打开此条件的 Contact 或 PhysBone 设置，以及它在 Scene 视图中的手柄。"

#. en: The trigger fires while any one of these groups is fully met.
msgid "ad.ui.when.any_of.tip"
msgstr "这些组中任意一组完全满足时，触发器即触发。"

#. en: GameObjects this control switches on or off.
msgid "ad.ui.objects.tip"
msgstr "此控件开启或关闭的对象。"

#. en: Blend shape weights this control drives on a skinned mesh.
msgid "ad.ui.blendshapes.tip"
msgstr "此控件在蒙皮网格上驱动的形态键权重。"

#. en: Material slots this control swaps while it is on.
msgid "ad.ui.materials.tip"
msgstr "此控件开启时替换的材质槽。"

#. en: Shader properties this control drives on a renderer's materials.
msgid "ad.ui.targets.properties.tip"
msgstr "此控件在渲染器材质上驱动的着色器属性。"

#. en: Your own animation clips merged into this control's generated one.
msgid "ad.ui.targets.animations.tip"
msgstr "合并到此控件生成的动画中的自定义动画剪辑。"

#. en: Adds an empty object row, or drag GameObjects from the Hierarchy onto the list instead.
msgid "ad.ui.objects.add.tip"
msgstr "添加一个空的对象行，也可以直接从 Hierarchy 把对象拖到列表上。"

#. en: Opens the shape picker to add another blend shape row.
msgid "ad.ui.blendshapes.add.tip"
msgstr "打开形态键选择器，再添加一行形态键。"

#. en: Adds a new material slot row to fill in.
msgid "ad.ui.materials.add.tip"
msgstr "添加一个新的材质槽行以供填写。"

#. en: Adds a new shader property row to drive.
msgid "ad.ui.targets.properties.add.tip"
msgstr "添加一个要驱动的着色器属性行。"

#. en: Adds a row for your own animation clip to merge in.
msgid "ad.ui.targets.animations.add.tip"
msgstr "添加一行，用于合并你自己的动画剪辑。"

#. en: Captures every blend shape of the chosen mesh that is above 0 right now; on a toggle it also holds the rest of that mesh at 0.
msgid "ad.ui.shape_set.capture.tip"
msgstr "捕获所选网格上当前大于 0 的所有形态键；在开关上还会将该网格的其余形态键保持为 0。"

#. en: The GameObject this row switches; drag one from the Hierarchy or pick it here.
msgid "ad.ui.target.object.tip"
msgstr "此行切换的对象；可从 Hierarchy 拖入，或在此选择。"

#. en: Shown when on shows this object while the control is on; Hidden when on does the opposite.
msgid "ad.ui.target.mode.tip"
msgstr "开启时显示：控件开启时显示此对象；开启时隐藏：效果相反。"

#. en: The blend shape this row drives; click to pick a different one.
msgid "ad.ui.target.shape.tip"
msgstr "此行驱动的形态键；点击可选择其他形态键。"

#. en: The shape's weight when the radial is at its lowest.
msgid "ad.ui.min.tip"
msgstr "转盘处于最低位置时该形态键的权重。"

#. en: The shape's weight when the radial is at its highest.
msgid "ad.ui.max.tip"
msgstr "转盘处于最高位置时该形态键的权重。"

#. en: Fixed weight goes from rest to its weight as the trigger comes on; Follow source copies the source shape times the multiplier.
msgid "ad.ui.effect.link_mode.tip"
msgstr "固定权重：触发器开启时从静止值变为设定权重；跟随源：复制源形态键的值并乘以倍率。"

#. en: How far this blend shape moves while the control is on.
msgid "ad.ui.weight.tip"
msgstr "控件开启时此形态键的变化量。"

#. en: Scales the source shape's own curve, clamped to the 0 to 100 range.
msgid "ad.ui.effect.multiplier.tip"
msgstr "缩放源形态键自身的曲线，结果限制在 0 到 100 之间。"

#. en: The weight this override holds the shape at; 0 switches it off.
msgid "ad.ui.override.value.tip"
msgstr "此覆盖将形态键保持在的权重；0 表示关闭该形态键。"

#. en: Fixed also captures the shape's off value; Pin writes nothing while off, so other animations can move the shape.
msgid "ad.ui.seg.fixed_pin.tip"
msgstr "固定：同时记录形态键的关闭值；钉住：关闭时不写入任何值，其他动画可以改变该形态键。"

#. en: The value written while the control is off instead of the scene's own value.
msgid "ad.ui.target.off_value.tip"
msgstr "控件关闭时写入的值，代替场景中原本的值。"

#. en: The renderer whose material slot this row swaps.
msgid "ad.ui.target.renderer.tip"
msgstr "此行替换其材质槽的渲染器。"

#. en: Which material slot of that renderer this row swaps, counted from 0.
msgid "ad.ui.slot.tip"
msgstr "此行替换的该渲染器材质槽的编号，从 0 开始计数。"

#. en: The material placed in that slot while the control is on.
msgid "ad.ui.target.material.tip"
msgstr "控件开启时放入该材质槽的材质。"

#. en: The renderer whose materials this row's shader property comes from.
msgid "ad.ui.property.renderer.tip"
msgstr "此行着色器属性所在材质的渲染器。"

#. en: The shader property this row drives; click to pick a different one.
msgid "ad.ui.property.pick_button.tip"
msgstr "此行驱动的着色器属性；点击可选择其他属性。"

#. en: Your own animation clip, merged into this control's generated one.
msgid "ad.ui.target.clip.tip"
msgstr "你自己的动画剪辑，会合并到此控件生成的动画中。"

#. en: This shape is already animated elsewhere on the avatar; the clips are listed here.
msgid "ad.ui.usage.chip.tip"
msgstr "此形态键已在 Avatar 的其他地方被动画控制；相关剪辑列在这里。"

#. en: Float, Colour or Vector: the kind of value this shader property holds.
msgid "ad.ui.property.value_type.tip"
msgstr "Float、Color 或 Vector：此着色器属性保存的值的类型。"

#. en: The property's value when the radial is at its lowest.
msgid "ad.ui.property.min.tip"
msgstr "转盘处于最低位置时该属性的值。"

#. en: The property's value when the radial is at its highest.
msgid "ad.ui.property.max.tip"
msgstr "转盘处于最高位置时该属性的值。"

#. en: The value written to the property while the control is on.
msgid "ad.ui.property.value.tip"
msgstr "控件开启时写入该属性的值。"

#. en: Holds every other shape of \"{0}\" while this is on; switched off, the rule stays but holds nothing.
msgid "ad.ui.shape_set.zero_others.tip"
msgstr "开启时保持“{0}”上的所有其他形态键；关闭此项后规则仍保留，但不保持任何形态键。"

#. en: Picks a mesh whose other shapes this holds at their default while it is on.
msgid "ad.ui.shape_set.hold.tip"
msgstr "选择一个网格，开启时将其其他形态键保持为默认值。"

#. en: What the other shapes are held at: their weight in the scene when you upload, or 0.
msgid "ad.ui.shape_set.value.tip"
msgstr "其他形态键保持为何值：上传时场景中的权重，或 0。"

#. en: Holds each other shape at the weight the scene shows when you upload.
msgid "ad.ui.shape_set.value.default.tip"
msgstr "将每个其他形态键保持为上传时场景中显示的权重。"

#. en: Holds each other shape at 0.
msgid "ad.ui.shape_set.value.zero.tip"
msgstr "将每个其他形态键保持为 0。"

#. en: Holds the shapes VRChat blinks with too, pausing blinking while this is on; off leaves blinking free.
msgid "ad.ui.shape_set.hold_blink.tip"
msgstr "同时保持 VRChat 用于眨眼的形态键，开启期间暂停眨眼；关闭则不限制眨眼。"

#. en: Holds the shapes VRChat speaks with too, pausing lip sync while this is on; off leaves lip sync free.
msgid "ad.ui.shape_set.hold_visemes.tip"
msgstr "同时保持 VRChat 用于口型同步的形态键，开启期间暂停口型同步；关闭则不限制口型同步。"

#. en: Removes this rule; the rows it captured stay.
msgid "ad.ui.shape_set.remove.tip"
msgstr "删除此规则；它捕获的行会保留。"

#. en: Plain suits a store page; Markdown adds a parameter table for a place that renders it.
msgid "ad.ui.summary.format.tip"
msgstr "纯文本适合商店页面；Markdown 会额外加入参数表，适合能显示 Markdown 的地方。"

#. en: The full summary text in the format chosen above; select and copy it directly if you prefer.
msgid "ad.ui.summary.text.tip"
msgstr "按上方所选格式生成的完整摘要文本；也可以直接选中并复制。"

#. en: Copies the summary text to the clipboard.
msgid "ad.ui.summary.copy.tip"
msgstr "将摘要文本复制到剪贴板。"

#. en: Shown in the locked banner for whoever uses this prefab.
msgid "ad.ui.lock.note.tip"
msgstr "显示在锁定提示栏中，供使用此预制件的人查看。"

#. en: Opens a copyable summary of this component, for a store page or documentation.
msgid "ad.ui.summary.toggle.tip"
msgstr "打开此组件的可复制摘要，可用于商店页面或说明文档。"

#. en: Submenu path this component's entries land in; empty means the avatar's root menu.
msgid "ad.ui.install.tip"
msgstr "此组件条目所在的子菜单路径；留空表示 Avatar 根菜单。"

#. en: Append items puts entries directly at the install path; As submenu wraps them in one new submenu there.
msgid "ad.ui.install.mode.tip"
msgstr "追加菜单项：将条目直接放到安装路径；作为子菜单：在该处将条目放进一个新的子菜单。"

#. en: The submenu's own name, used only while Install as is As submenu.
msgid "ad.ui.menu_name.tip"
msgstr "子菜单自身的名称，仅在“安装方式”为“作为子菜单”时使用。"

#. en: The icon on the submenu control this component installs.
msgid "ad.ui.menu_icon.tip"
msgstr "此组件安装的子菜单控件上的图标。"

#. en: Automatic parameter names are prefix/name; changing it renames every automatic parameter at once.
msgid "ad.ui.prefix.tip"
msgstr "自动命名的参数名为“前缀/名称”；修改前缀会同时重命名所有自动命名的参数。"

#. en: Sets what every entry under this component builds on, unless an entry says otherwise.
msgid "ad.ui.platform.component.tip"
msgstr "设置此组件下所有条目在哪些平台上构建，除非条目另有设置。"

#. en: Clears every scene preview you set, on every avatar in the editor, in one press.
msgid "ad.ui.preview.reset.tip"
msgstr "一键清除编辑器中所有 Avatar 上你设置的场景预览。"

#. en: Removes this menu edit whose target is already gone.
msgid "ad.ui.edit.remove.tip"
msgstr "移除这条目标已不存在的菜单修改。"

#. en: Shows the avatar's own synced bits, AvatarDoc's added share, and how many of VRChat's 256 bits are still free.
msgid "ad.ui.memory.bar.tip"
msgstr "显示 Avatar 自身的同步参数 bits、AvatarDoc 新增的部分，以及 VRChat 的 256 bits 中还剩多少。"

#. en: Select clicks a wedge to choose it; Test clicks a wedge to preview it on the avatar instead.
msgid "ad.ui.wheel.mode.tip"
msgstr "选择：点击扇区以选中它；测试：点击扇区以在 Avatar 上预览它。"

#. en: Click a wedge to select or open it; in Test mode a click previews it on the avatar instead.
msgid "ad.ui.wheel.ring.tip"
msgstr "点击扇区以选中或打开它；在测试模式下，点击会在 Avatar 上预览它。"

#. en: Drags this radial's own preview value; the ring's accent arc follows it live.
msgid "ad.ui.wheel.radial_slider.tip"
msgstr "拖动以调整此转盘的预览值；圆环上的高亮弧线会实时跟随。"

#. en: Presses simulate a parameter, contact or PhysBone trigger without waiting for its real condition.
msgid "ad.ui.wheel.triggers_strip.tip"
msgstr "按下按钮即可模拟参数、Contact 或 PhysBone 触发器，无需等待真实条件。"

#. en: Toggles hidden from the menu still show here in Test mode, so you can try them.
msgid "ad.ui.wheel.not_in_menu.tip"
msgstr "在测试模式下，未显示在菜单中的开关仍会显示在这里，方便你试用。"

#. en: Presses this trigger once; press again to release it.
msgid "ad.ui.wheel.trigger_button.tip"
msgstr "按下此触发器一次；再按一次即可松开。"

#. en: Flips this hidden toggle's own preview, the same as its panel would.
msgid "ad.ui.wheel.hidden_button.tip"
msgstr "翻转此隐藏开关的预览，效果与在其面板中操作相同。"

#. en: Steps back to that submenu in the wheel.
msgid "ad.ui.wheel.crumb.tip"
msgstr "在轮盘中返回到该子菜单。"

#. en: Adds a toggle that switches its own targets on or off.
msgid "ad.ui.add.toggle.tip"
msgstr "添加一个开启或关闭其目标的开关。"

#. en: Adds a control that blends its targets between two ends as its value moves from 0 to 1.
msgid "ad.ui.add.radial.tip"
msgstr "添加一个控件，其值从 0 变到 1 时，目标在两端之间平滑过渡。"

#. en: Adds a new submenu that other controls can be placed inside.
msgid "ad.ui.add.submenu.tip"
msgstr "添加一个可放入其他控件的新子菜单。"

#. en: Adds a rule that fires its effects on its own, with no button in the menu and no synced bits.
msgid "ad.ui.add.trigger.tip"
msgstr "添加一条自动触发效果的规则，不占用菜单按钮，也不占用同步参数。"

#. en: Adds a rule that holds a blend shape at one value in every animation that already uses it.
msgid "ad.ui.add.override.tip"
msgstr "添加一条规则，在所有已使用某个形态键的动画中，将其保持在一个值。"

#. en: Adds a button that puts several other controls into one state at once.
msgid "ad.ui.add.preset.tip"
msgstr "添加一个按钮，一次将多个其他控件设为指定状态。"

#. en: Adds an existing animator controller's layers to the build, the way a Modular Avatar Merge Animator does.
msgid "ad.ui.add.animator.tip"
msgstr "将现有 Animator Controller 的层加入构建，作用与 Modular Avatar 的 Merge Animator 相同。"

#. en: Installs a whole finished expressions menu into this menu.
msgid "ad.ui.add.menu_asset.tip"
msgstr "将一整个现成的 Expressions 菜单安装到此菜单中。"

#. en: Opens a wizard that builds a whole outfit selector from GameObjects at once.
msgid "ad.ui.add.outfit.tip"
msgstr "打开向导，一次用多个对象生成完整的服装切换菜单。"

#. en: Shows the selected submenu as VRChat's own radial menu would draw it.
msgid "ad.ui.wheel.toggle.tip"
msgstr "按 VRChat 自身圆盘菜单的样式显示所选子菜单。"

#. en: Filters the tree to rows whose name matches what you type; a submenu stays open while something inside it matches.
msgid "ad.ui.search.tip"
msgstr "按输入内容筛选名称匹配的行；子菜单内有匹配项时，该子菜单保持展开。"

#. en: Search
msgid "ad.ui.search.placeholder"
msgstr "搜索"

#. en: AvatarDoc on '{0}' took {1} ms to refresh: plan {2} ms, header {3} ms, menu tree {4} ms, entry panel {5} ms, other {6} ms; the plan was dropped by: {7}. Please send this line to the developer if it keeps happening.
msgid "ad.log.slow_refresh"
msgstr "“{0}”上的 AvatarDoc 刷新耗时 {1} ms：计划 {2} ms，标题栏 {3} ms，菜单树 {4} ms，条目面板 {5} ms，其他 {6} ms；计划被以下原因丢弃：{7}。如果此情况反复出现，请将这一行发送给开发者。"

#. en: An AvatarDoc menu closed by itself: {0}. The plan was last dropped by: {1}. Please send this line to the developer if it keeps happening.
msgid "ad.log.menu_closed"
msgstr "AvatarDoc 的一个菜单自行关闭了：{0}。计划上一次被以下原因丢弃：{1}。如果此情况反复出现，请将这一行发送给开发者。"

#. en: the panel it belongs to was rebuilt or closed
msgid "ad.log.menu_closed.view_gone"
msgstr "所属面板被重建或关闭"

#. en: its window took it away
msgid "ad.log.menu_closed.removed"
msgstr "所在窗口移除了它"

#. en: the window changed size
msgid "ad.log.menu_closed.resized"
msgstr "窗口大小发生变化"

#. en: an undo or redo changed the data under it
msgid "ad.log.menu_closed.undo"
msgstr "撤销或重做改变了其下的数据"

#. en: the window lost the focus to {0}
msgid "ad.log.menu_closed.window_focus"
msgstr "窗口焦点转移到了 {0}"

#. en: the focus kept moving to {0}
msgid "ad.log.menu_closed.focus_taken"
msgstr "焦点不断转移到 {0}"

#. en: another application
msgid "ad.log.menu_closed.other_app"
msgstr "其他应用程序"

#. en: nothing
msgid "ad.log.menu_closed.nothing"
msgstr "无"

#. en: nothing, the plan was reused
msgid "ad.log.plan_reused"
msgstr "无，计划被复用"

#. en: AvatarDoc on '{0}' used item ids that another AvatarDoc on this avatar already has, which happens when a component is copied. The repeated ids were given new ones, which is why the scene shows as changed.
msgid "ad.log.ids_repaired"
msgstr "“{0}”上的 AvatarDoc 使用了此 Avatar 上另一个 AvatarDoc 已有的条目 ID，这通常是复制组件导致的。重复的 ID 已替换为新的 ID，因此场景显示为已修改。"

#. en: This piece's own shapes copy a shape of another mesh, wherever that mesh is animated.
msgid "ad.ui.shapes.follows.tip"
msgstr "此部件自身的形态键会复制另一个网格的形态键，无论那个网格在哪里被动画控制。"

#. en: Adds a row that copies a shape from another mesh onto this piece.
msgid "ad.ui.shapes.add_follow.tip"
msgstr "添加一行，把另一个网格的形态键复制到此部件上。"

#. en: Holds a shape on any mesh at a value while this piece is switched on.
msgid "ad.ui.shapes.while_on.tip"
msgstr "此部件开启时，将任意网格上的某个形态键保持在一个值。"

#. en: Adds a row that holds a mesh's shape at a value while this piece is on.
msgid "ad.ui.shapes.add_while_on.tip"
msgstr "添加一行，在此部件开启时将某个网格的形态键保持在一个值。"

#. en: A piece left out on this platform writes none of these shape values there.
msgid "ad.ui.shapes.platform.tip"
msgstr "在此平台上被排除的部件，在该平台上不会写入这些形态键值。"

#. en: The mesh to read the source shape from, usually the body.
msgid "ad.ui.shapes.source_mesh.tip"
msgstr "读取源形态键的网格，通常是身体。"

#. en: The mesh to change while this object is on, usually the body.
msgid "ad.ui.shapes.mesh.tip"
msgstr "此对象开启时要修改的网格，通常是身体。"

#. en: How much this shape is held at while the object is on.
msgid "ad.ui.shapes.value.tip"
msgstr "对象开启时此形态键保持的值。"

#. en: The shape on the source mesh to copy.
msgid "ad.ui.shapes.source_shape.tip"
msgstr "要复制的源网格上的形态键。"

#. en: The shape on this piece that copies the source; Same name uses the source's own name.
msgid "ad.ui.shapes.local_shape.tip"
msgstr "此部件上复制源的形态键；“同名”表示使用与源相同的名称。"

#. en: The shape on that mesh to hold at a value while this object is on.
msgid "ad.ui.shapes.shape.tip"
msgstr "此对象开启时，该网格上要保持在某个值的形态键。"

#. en: Ticks every candidate that can be converted.
msgid "ad.ui.import.select_all.tip"
msgstr "勾选所有可转换的候选项。"

#. en: Unticks every candidate.
msgid "ad.ui.import.select_none.tip"
msgstr "取消勾选所有候选项。"

#. en: Creates AvatarDoc entries for every ticked candidate; Remove originals also takes away the old components.
msgid "ad.ui.import.button.tip"
msgstr "为每个勾选的候选项创建 AvatarDoc 条目；开启“移除原件”还会移除旧组件。"

#. en: Brings this layer's old control and layer back together, undoing its conversion.
msgid "ad.ui.import.restore.tip"
msgstr "恢复此层原来的控件和层，撤销其转换。"

#. en: Tick to include this item in the conversion.
msgid "ad.ui.import.candidate.tip"
msgstr "勾选以将此项纳入转换。"

#. en: Names the submenu and exclusive group this wizard builds.
msgid "ad.ui.outfit.name.tip"
msgstr "此向导生成的子菜单和互斥组的名称。"

#. en: One at a time makes one exclusive toggle per outfit; Mix freely lets several pieces be worn together.
msgid "ad.ui.outfit.mode.tip"
msgstr "一次一套：每套服装生成一个互斥开关；自由搭配：允许同时穿戴多个部件。"

#. en: Adds a None choice that leaves every outfit off and shows the pieces hidden while any outfit is on.
msgid "ad.ui.outfit.none_option.tip"
msgstr "添加一个“无”选项：不穿任何服装，并显示穿任意服装时隐藏的部件。"

#. en: Adds a new, empty outfit card to drop pieces onto.
msgid "ad.ui.outfit.add.tip"
msgstr "添加一张新的空服装卡片，可将部件拖到上面。"

#. en: Pieces here are turned off by every outfit's own toggle, so they disappear once any outfit is worn.
msgid "ad.ui.outfit.hidden.tip"
msgstr "这里的部件会被每套服装的开关关闭，因此只要穿上任意一套服装，它们就会消失。"

#. en: Captures an icon automatically for every entry the wizard creates that has pieces.
msgid "ad.ui.outfit.capture.tip"
msgstr "为向导创建的每个带部件的条目自动拍摄图标。"

#. en: Builds the submenu, groups or presets and shrink shapes, all in one Undo step.
msgid "ad.ui.outfit.create.tip"
msgstr "生成子菜单、互斥组或预设以及收缩形态键，全部可一步撤销。"

#. en: Makes one outfit for every object you dropped.
msgid "ad.ui.outfit.split.each.tip"
msgstr "为拖入的每个对象各生成一套服装。"

#. en: Makes one outfit holding every object you dropped together.
msgid "ad.ui.outfit.split.all.tip"
msgstr "将拖入的所有对象合为一套服装。"

#. en: This outfit's own name, shown as its toggle or preset label.
msgid "ad.ui.outfit.card_name.tip"
msgstr "此服装自身的名称，会作为其开关或预设的标签显示。"

#. en: Click to make this the outfit that starts on.
msgid "ad.ui.outfit.default.tip"
msgstr "点击可将此服装设为默认开启的服装。"

#. en: Tick a suggestion to add it as a blend shape target on the toggle that shows this piece.
msgid "ad.ui.outfit.shrinks.tip"
msgstr "勾选建议项，即可将其作为形态键目标添加到显示此部件的开关上。"

#. en: Adds this shape as a blend shape target on the toggle that shows this piece; only tick a real match.
msgid "ad.ui.outfit.shrink_toggle.tip"
msgstr "将此形态键作为形态键目标添加到显示此部件的开关上；请只勾选真正匹配的项。"

#. en: Shows every shrink suggestion for this piece, not just the first eight.
msgid "ad.ui.outfit.show_all.tip"
msgstr "显示此部件的所有收缩建议，而不仅是前八个。"

#. en: Opens the avatar picker to add a piece, as an alternative to dragging from the Hierarchy.
msgid "ad.ui.outfit.add_piece.tip"
msgstr "打开 Avatar 选择器来添加部件，也可以从 Hierarchy 拖入。"

#. en: Transparent clears to nothing; Solid colour fills behind the pieces with the colour beside it.
msgid "ad.ui.capture.background.tip"
msgstr "透明：背景留空；纯色：用旁边的颜色填充部件后方。"

#. en: The colour drawn behind the pieces when the background is Solid colour.
msgid "ad.ui.capture.color.tip"
msgstr "背景为“纯色”时，绘制在部件后方的颜色。"

#. en: Points the camera at this entry's own pieces and freezes the framing until you press it again.
msgid "ad.ui.capture.fit.tip"
msgstr "将相机对准此条目自身的部件，并固定取景，直到再次按下。"

#. en: Writes the preview as this entry's icon; capturing again under the same name overwrites the same file.
msgid "ad.ui.capture.save.tip"
msgstr "将预览保存为此条目的图标；以相同名称再次拍摄会覆盖同一文件。"

#. en: This control was installed from a finished menu asset rather than built here directly.
msgid "ad.ui.chip.asset.tip"
msgstr "此控件是从现成的菜单资源安装的，而不是直接在此构建的。"

#. en: Allows editing this component again.
msgid "ad.ui.unlock.tip"
msgstr "重新允许编辑此组件。"

#. en: Where the radial sits when the avatar loads.
msgid "ad.ui.default_value.tip"
msgstr "Avatar 加载时转盘所处的位置。"

#. en: While this control is on, or this trigger is met, each object here follows its target instead of hanging where it belongs.
msgid "ad.ui.targets.follows.tip"
msgstr "此控件开启或此触发器满足时，这里的每个对象都会跟随其目标，而不是停留在原来的位置。"

#. en: Adds an object that follows another transform while this control is on or this trigger is met.
msgid "ad.ui.targets.follows.add.tip"
msgstr "添加一个对象，在此控件开启或此触发器满足时跟随另一个 Transform。"

#. en: The object that moves. It must already be part of this avatar.
msgid "ad.ui.target.follow_object.tip"
msgstr "要移动的对象。它必须属于此 Avatar。"

#. en: The transform the object follows while this control is on or this trigger is met.
msgid "ad.ui.target.follow_target.tip"
msgstr "此控件开启或此触发器满足时，对象所跟随的 Transform。"

#. en: On: keeps the pose the object has relative to the target right now, as you posed it in the scene. Off: it snaps exactly onto the target's own origin.
msgid "ad.ui.target.keep_offset.tip"
msgstr "开启：保持对象当前相对于目标的姿态，即你在场景中摆好的样子。关闭：对象会精确吸附到目标自身的原点。"

#. en: Adds a grabbable: pick an object and AvatarDoc builds the PhysBone, the contacts and the follow that let a hand hold it.
msgid "ad.ui.add.grabbable.tip"
msgstr "添加可抓取物：选择一个对象，AvatarDoc 会构建让手能握住它的 PhysBone、Contact 和跟随。"

#. en: The object a hand can pick up. It must already be part of this avatar.
msgid "ad.ui.grab.object.tip"
msgstr "手可以拿起的对象。它必须属于此 Avatar。"

#. en: Which hand or hands may hold this object.
msgid "ad.ui.grab.hands.tip"
msgstr "可以握住此对象的手。"

#. en: On: other players may grab it too. Off: only its own wearer can.
msgid "ad.ui.grab.anyone.tip"
msgstr "开启：其他玩家也可以抓取它。关闭：只有穿戴者本人可以抓取。"

#. en: Seconds the object takes to blend back to its rest place once released.
msgid "ad.ui.grab.return_seconds.tip"
msgstr "松开后对象平滑回到静止位置所需的秒数。"

#. en: On: adds a normal menu toggle that turns grabbing on and off. Off: grabbing is always available and the entry has no menu control of its own.
msgid "ad.ui.grab.menu_toggle.tip"
msgstr "开启：添加一个普通菜单开关，用于开启或关闭抓取。关闭：始终可以抓取，此条目没有自己的菜单控件。"

#. en: How close the hand has to be to grab it, as a multiplier on the size AvatarDoc already computes.
msgid "ad.ui.grab.reach.tip"
msgstr "手需要靠多近才能抓取，以 AvatarDoc 已计算出的大小的倍率表示。"

#. en: Shows who may grab it, how long it takes to return, its reach, and its menu toggle.
msgid "ad.ui.grab.fold.tip"
msgstr "显示谁可以抓取、归位所需时间、抓取范围以及菜单开关。"

#. en: Clear the search to move rows.
msgid "ad.info.drag_needs_no_search"
msgstr "请清除搜索后再移动行。"

