msgstr "请清除搜索和标签筛选后再移动行。"

#. en: Clear the tag filters to move rows.
msgid "ad.info.drag_needs_no_tags"
msgstr "请清除标签筛选后再移动行。"

#. en: A toggle switches its targets on or off from the menu. Drag an object onto the tree, or add an effect below, to give it something to switch.
msgid "ad.tip.toggle"
msgstr "开关可以从菜单中开启或关闭其目标。把对象拖到菜单树上，或在下方添加效果，为它指定要切换的内容。"

#. en: A radial blends its targets between two ends as its slider moves, instead of switching them on or off. Add a blend shape below and set what its low and high ends look like.
msgid "ad.tip.radial"
msgstr "转盘（VRChat 的 Radial Puppet）会随滑块移动，让目标在两端之间平滑过渡，而不是简单地开启或关闭。在下方添加形态键，并设置最低端和最高端的样子。"

#. en: A submenu groups other entries under one menu button. Drag entries into it, or add new ones while it is selected, to fill it.
msgid "ad.tip.submenu"
msgstr "子菜单把其他条目归到一个菜单按钮下。把条目拖进去，或在选中它时添加新条目，即可填充它。"

#. en: A trigger fires its effects on its own, from a toggle, a parameter, a touch or a blend shape, without taking a menu slot of its own. Pick what starts it below.
msgid "ad.tip.trigger"
msgstr "触发器会根据开关、参数、触碰或形态键自动触发效果，不占用菜单位置。请在下方选择由什么启动它。"

#. en: An override holds a blend shape at one value in every animation that already uses it, so nothing else can fight it. Add the shape it should hold below.
msgid "ad.tip.override"
msgstr "覆盖会在所有已使用某个形态键的动画中将其保持在一个值，其他东西都无法与之冲突。请在下方添加要保持的形态键。"

#. en: A preset puts several other controls into one state with a single button. Add the states it should set below.
msgid "ad.tip.preset"
msgstr "预设可以用一个按钮将多个其他控件设为指定状态。请在下方添加要设置的状态。"

#. en: A grabbable lets a creator pick up and hold an object in a hand. Pick the object and which hand or hands below.
msgid "ad.tip.grabbable"
msgstr "可抓取物让人可以用手拿起并握住一个对象。请在下方选择对象以及使用哪只手。"

#. en: A merged animator brings an existing controller's layers straight into the build, unchanged. Pick the controller below.
msgid "ad.tip.animator"
msgstr "合并 Animator 会把现有控制器的层原样直接加入构建。请在下方选择控制器。"

#. en: An installed menu asset brings a finished menu asset into the build as it already is. Pick the asset above.
msgid "ad.tip.menu_asset"
msgstr "已安装的菜单资源会把现成的菜单资源原样加入构建。请在上方选择资源。"

#. en: This header holds the component's own install settings and the avatar's shared memory bar. Add your first entry in the tree below to get started.
