msgstr "此标题栏包含组件自身的安装设置和 Avatar 共用的参数用量条。在下方菜单树中添加第一个条目即可开始。"

#. en: This header shows whether the avatar is ready to upload and how much of VRChat's memory the menu uses. Add your first entry in the tree below to get started.
msgid "ad.tip.header.simple"
msgstr "此标题栏显示 Avatar 是否可以上传，以及菜单占用了多少 VRChat 参数空间。在下方菜单树中添加第一个条目即可开始。"

#. en: Simple
msgid "ad.ui.mode.simple"
msgstr "简易"

#. en: Advanced
msgid "ad.ui.mode.advanced"
msgstr "高级"

#. en: Simple shows only what most avatars need; Advanced shows every tool. Nothing you made is hidden.
msgid "ad.ui.mode.tip"
msgstr "简易：只显示大多数 Avatar 需要的内容；高级：显示所有工具。你制作的内容都不会被隐藏。"

#. en: This is an advanced item; switch to Advanced to add more like it.
msgid "ad.ui.advanced_item.note"
msgstr "这是高级条目；切换到“高级”即可添加更多同类条目。"

#. en: \"{0}\" follows {1}, but that shape also moves in {2}, outside the FX layer, where the trigger cannot see it. Move that animation into the FX layer if the trigger should react to it there.
msgid "ad.warn.link_clips_outside_fx"
msgstr "“{0}”跟随 {1}，但该形态键也在 FX 层之外的 {2} 中变化，触发器无法感知那里的变化。如果希望触发器对其作出反应，请将该动画移到 FX 层中。"

#. en: \"{0}\" follows {1}, which VRChat moves itself for blinking or lip sync outside every animation, so the trigger never sees it move. Pick a shape your own animations move instead. ({2})
msgid "ad.warn.link_source_tracked"
msgstr "“{0}”跟随 {1}，而它由 VRChat 在所有动画之外自行控制（用于眨眼或口型同步），触发器永远感知不到它的变化。请改选由你自己的动画控制的形态键。（{2}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" starts at {1} but is fully on at {2}, which is not above it, so it is fully on just above Starts at instead. Set Fully on at higher than Starts at. ({3})
msgid "ad.warn.smooth_range"
msgstr "“{0}”开始于 {1}，但完全开启于 {2}，并不高于开始值，因此改为刚超过“开始于”就完全开启。请将“完全开启于”设得比“开始于”更高。（{3}）"

#. en: \"{0}\" reads only the card its shape is in, so the conditions in its other cards are kept but not used. Move what you need into the first card with + And, or remove the other cards. ({1})
msgid "ad.warn.requirements_one_card"
msgstr "“{0}”只读取其形态键所在的卡片，因此其他卡片中的条件会保留但不使用。请用“+ 且”把需要的条件移到第一张卡片中，或删除其他卡片。（{1}）"

#. en: Style
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.style"
msgstr "样式"

#. en: Smooth blends the effects in as the shape moves; Switch turns them fully on at one weight.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.style.tip"
msgstr "平滑：效果随形态键变化逐渐出现；切换：在某个权重处让效果完全开启。"

#. en: Smooth
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.style.smooth"
msgstr "平滑"

#. en: The effects blend in from Starts at to Fully on at as the shape moves.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.style.smooth.tip"
msgstr "随形态键变化，效果从“开始于”到“完全开启于”逐渐出现。"

#. en: Switch
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.style.switch"
msgstr "切换"

#. en: The effects switch fully on once the shape reaches Switch at.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.style.switch.tip"
msgstr "形态键达到“切换于”时，效果立即完全开启。"

#. en: Starts at
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.smooth_start"
msgstr "开始于"

#. en: The shape weight at which the effects start to come in.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.smooth_start.tip"
msgstr "效果开始出现时的形态键权重。"

#. en: Fully on at
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.smooth_full"
msgstr "完全开启于"

#. en: The shape weight at which the effects are fully on.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.smooth_full.tip"
msgstr "效果完全开启时的形态键权重。"

#. en: Switch at
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.switch_at"
msgstr "切换于"

#. en: The shape weight at which the whole trigger switches on.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.switch_at.tip"
msgstr "整个触发器开启时的形态键权重。"

#. en: Swaps at
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.swap_at"
msgstr "替换于"

#. en: The shape weight at which objects switch and materials swap, since those cannot blend.
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.swap_at.tip"
msgstr "对象切换和材质替换时的形态键权重，因为它们无法平滑过渡。"

#. en: Add
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.mode.add"
msgstr "叠加"

#. en: Replace
msgid "ad.ui.trigger.mode.replace"
msgstr "替换"

#. en: \"{0}\" moves
msgid "ad.ui.when.shape_moves"
msgstr "“{0}”变化"

#. en: a hand comes near \"{0}\"
msgid "ad.ui.when.hand_near"
msgstr "手靠近“{0}”"

#. en: Adds a requirement: while any requirement fails, the effects rest.
msgid "ad.ui.when.add_requirement.tip"
msgstr "添加一个前提：只要有任一前提不满足，效果就保持静止。"

#. en: This card holds at most {0} rows, its first row included.
msgid "ad.ui.when.add_and.limit_driver.tip"
msgstr "此卡片最多 {0} 行，包括第一行。"

#. en: Each + And adds a requirement. While any requirement fails, the effects rest; while all hold, the first row moves them.
msgid "ad.ui.when.requirements_note"
msgstr "每个“+ 且”添加一个前提。只要有任一前提不满足，效果就保持静止；所有前提都满足时，由第一行驱动效果。"

#. en: The preview cannot check a parameter, contact or PhysBone requirement, so it counts those as met.
msgid "ad.ui.preview.unchecked"
msgstr "预览无法检查参数、Contact 或 PhysBone 前提，因此视其为已满足。"

#. en: blends from {0} to {1}
msgid "ad.ui.builds.smooth"
msgstr "从 {0} 到 {1} 平滑过渡"

#. en: switches at {0}
msgid "ad.ui.builds.switch"
msgstr "在 {0} 处切换"

#. en: a hidden copy of the shape's weight, no synced bits
msgid "ad.ui.builds.mirror"
msgstr "形态键权重的隐藏副本，不占用同步参数"

#. en: a hidden copy of a blend shape's weight, never synced
msgid "ad.summary.parameters.mirror"
msgstr "形态键权重的隐藏副本，从不同步"

#. en: No animation in the FX layer moves {1}, so \"{0}\" cannot follow that shape and its effects stay where the shape rests. Animate {1} in an FX animation, or pick a shape one already moves.
msgid "ad.warn.link_no_fx_clip"
msgstr "FX 层中没有动画改变 {1}，因此“{0}”无法跟随该形态键，其效果停留在形态键静止时对应的状态。请在 FX 动画中为 {1} 制作动画，或选择已有动画改变的形态键。"

#. en: Kept but not used
msgid "ad.ui.when.ignored"
msgstr "保留但未使用"

#. en: A blend shape trigger reads only its first card, so this card is kept for you to move or remove what it holds.
msgid "ad.ui.when.ignored.tip"
msgstr "形态键触发器只读取第一张卡片，因此保留这张卡片，方便你移动或删除其中的内容。"

#. en: Blinking pauses while the effects are on
msgid "ad.ui.builds.pauses_blink_shape"
msgstr "效果开启时暂停眨眼"

#. en: Lip sync pauses while the effects are on
msgid "ad.ui.builds.pauses_lipsync_shape"
msgstr "效果开启时暂停口型同步"

#. en: The language AvatarDoc is shown in, shared with Modular Avatar and NDMF.
msgid "ad.ui.language.tip"
msgstr "AvatarDoc 的显示语言，与 Modular Avatar 和 NDMF 共用。"

#. en: ,
msgid "ad.ui.list.separator"
msgstr "、"

#. en: {0} ({1})
msgid "ad.ui.aside"
msgstr "{0}（{1}）"

#. en: ({0})
msgid "ad.ui.brackets"
msgstr "（{0}）"

#. en: \"{0}\"
msgid "ad.ui.quoted"
msgstr "“{0}”"

#. en: {0}: {1}
msgid "ad.ui.labelled"
msgstr "{0}：{1}"

#. en: Name
msgid "ad.summary.parameters.name"
msgstr "名称"

#. en: Type
msgid "ad.summary.parameters.type"
msgstr "类型"

#. en: Notes
msgid "ad.summary.parameters.notes"
msgstr "备注"

#. en: s
msgid "ad.ui.blend.unit"
msgstr "秒"

#. en: Type to filter the list. Up and Down move through the results, Enter picks the highlighted one, Escape clears the search.
msgid "ad.ui.pick.search.tip"
msgstr "输入内容以筛选列表。上下方向键在结果间移动，Enter 选择高亮项，Esc 清除搜索。"

#. en: Nothing matches \"{0}\".
msgid "ad.ui.pick.no_match"
msgstr "没有与“{0}”匹配的项。"

#. en: {0} more. Type more letters to narrow the list.
msgid "ad.ui.pick.more"
msgstr "还有 {0} 项。继续输入以缩小范围。"

#. en: {0} more. Type more letters to narrow the list.
msgid "ad.ui.pick.more.one"
msgstr "还有 {0} 项。继续输入以缩小范围。"
